  ('342160109081383185', '"We never make mistakes"', 'Александр Исаевич Солженицын', 1963, 'World Literature', '"We never make mistakes" by Александр Исаевич Солженицын. A world literature book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1858612W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL1858612W-'),
  ('45705729711475463', '[ Donald Preziosi] The Art Of Art History A Critic( Book ZZ.org)', 'Donald Preziosi', 2009, 'Classic Literature', 'Here is a new edition of Donald Preziosi''s masterful selection of the most influential and innovative writing on art history of the past two centuries. The book includes over thirty pieces by seminal thinkers and writers from Winckelmann, Kant, and Hegel to Foucault, Carol Duncan, and Mary Kelly on such subjects as aesthetics and anthropology, postmodern automatons, semiotics and iconography, performative acts, the museum as ritual, digital art, and many others. Each of the book''s eight thematic sections offers an introduction providing background information, further reading, and critical commentary on the issues at stake. This edition has been updated and expanded to include sixteen new selections by key figures from Giorgio Vasari to Walter Benjamin and Satya Mohanty, a new concluding essay from Donald Preziosi on the tasks of the art historian today, and an entirely new section on Globalization and Its Discontents. For students and teachers, artists and historians, and anyone interested in the evolution and purpose of art history, this anthology offers many fascinating insights.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/donaldpreziositheartofarthistoryacriticbookzz.org', 'https://archive.org/details/donaldpreziositheartofarthistoryacriticbookzz.org', 'internet-archive:donaldpreziositheartofarthistoryacriticbookzz.org'),
  ('90025072611626966', '[ Ed Piskor] Hip Hop Family Tree Vol 1 1970s 1981 Kindle', 'Ed Piskor', 2013, 'History', 'The lore of the early days of hip hop has become the stuff of myth, so what better way to document this fascinating, epic true story than in another great American mythological medium - the comic book? From exciting young talent and self-proclaimed hip hop nerd Ed Piskor, acclaimed for his hacker graphic novel Wizzywig, comes this explosively entertaining, encyclopedic history of the formative years of the music genre that changed global culture. "This is the comic of all time." - Biz Markie', 'https://archive.org/services/img/EdPiskorHipHopFamilyTreeVol11970s1981Kindle', 'https://archive.org/details/EdPiskorHipHopFamilyTreeVol11970s1981Kindle', 'internet-archive:EdPiskorHipHopFamilyTreeVol11970s1981Kindle'),
  ('408157200509766278', '[Bahasa Indonesia] Haunting Adeline (Cat And Mouse # 1)', 'H.D. Carlton', 2021, 'Mystery', 'Haunting Adeline adalah kisah tentang Addie, seorang penulis yang tinggal sendirian di rumah besar yang angker, yang dia warisi dari neneknya. Tak lama setelah pindah, dia menemukan sebuah rahasia kelam; ternyata nenek buyutnya dibunuh di rumah itu dan pelakunya tidak pernah tertangkap. Saat berusaha mengungkap misteri kematian neneknya, dia secara tidak sengaja terjebak dalam situasi yang sama. The Manipulator Aku bisa memanipulasi emosi siapa pun yang memberiku kesempatan. Aku akan membuatmu terluka, membuatmu menangis, membuatmu tertawa dan menghela napas. Tapi kata-kataku tidak memengaruhinya. Terutama saat aku memohon agar dia pergi. Dia selalu di sana, mengamati dan menunggu. Dan aku tidak pernah bisa berpaling. Tidak saat aku ingin dia semakin dekat. The Shadow Aku tidak berniat jatuh cinta. Tapi sekarang aku sudah jatuh cinta, aku tidak bisa menjauh. Aku terpesona oleh senyumnya, oleh matanya, dan cara dia bergerak. Cara dia membuka pakaiannya... Aku akan terus mengamati dan menunggu. Sampai aku bisa membuatnya menjadi milikku. Dan begitu dia menjadi milikku, aku tidak akan pernah melepaskannya. Tidak peduli meskipun dia memintaku untuk melepaskannya.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/preview-haunting-adeline-cat-and-mouse-1-by-h.-d.-carlton', 'https://archive.org/details/preview-haunting-adeline-cat-and-mouse-1-by-h.-d.-carlton', 'internet-archive:preview-haunting-adeline-cat-and-mouse-1-by-h.-d.-carlton'),
