  ('38606821671119399', 'A Bibliography of Anthony Scott Veitch’s Western Stories Written for Cleveland Publishing', 'Anders N. Nilsson', 2026, 'Literature', 'The about 120 western stories written by the Australian author and playwright Anthony Scott Veitch (1914-1983) for Cleveland Publishing are listed together with all their known editions. Reviews based on Swedish translations are given for 28 novels. Front covers of selected first editions from the two series Cleveland Western and Cougar Western are shown together with most of those found on the Norwegian and Swedish translations. Veitch mainly used the pen name Scott McLure for his western, but also J. Cobb Collier, Clint Derrett and Dan Kestrel were used by him. Veitch wrote mostly stand-alone novels, but also the three short series Nine Lives of Bodie Clay, Johnny Macaw, and Kelsey Brand.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/nilsson_2026_veitch_bibliography', 'https://archive.org/details/nilsson_2026_veitch_bibliography', 'internet-archive:nilsson_2026_veitch_bibliography'),
