  ('377246638473702795', 'A Bibliography of South Asian Ornithology 1713 to 2022. 5th edition', 'Aasheesh Pittie', 2026, 'Biography', 'This is an ongoing project as an author bibliography of South Asian Ornithology, from 1713 to 2022. It also contains brief biographies of some authors.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/pittie-bibliography-south-asian-ornithology-1713-2022-17032026-ed-6', 'https://archive.org/details/pittie-bibliography-south-asian-ornithology-1713-2022-17032026-ed-6', 'internet-archive:pittie-bibliography-south-asian-ornithology-1713-2022-17032026-ed-6'),
