  ('871336634108216442', 'A Critical History And Filmography Of Toho''s Godzilla', 'a critical history and filmogaphy of toho''s godzilla book', 2025, 'History', 'pretty great book about all godzilla of filmography for history.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-critical-history-and-filmography-of-tohos-godzilla-david-kalat-2nd-edition-201', 'https://archive.org/details/a-critical-history-and-filmography-of-tohos-godzilla-david-kalat-2nd-edition-201', 'internet-archive:a-critical-history-and-filmography-of-tohos-godzilla-david-kalat-2nd-edition-201'),
  ('971378656351858419', 'A Critique Of Science And Karl Popper''s Swan Induction. Marcio Alexandre Afonso Polizelli', 'Marcio Alexandre Afonso Polizelli', 2026, 'Science', 'Popper argues that we cannot definitively confirm the truth of a general law solely through repeated observations. For example, observing numerous white swans does not prove that all swans are white. However, the sighting of a single black swan is sufficient to refute the claim that all swans are white. One problem with this statement is that it can be refuted (Black Swan and White Swan are not birds of the same species). The white swan (Cygnus olor) and the black swan (Cygnus atratus) are distinct species, with different genetics and habitats.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-critique-of-science-and-karl-poppers-swan-induction.-marcio-alexandre-afonso-polizelli', 'https://archive.org/details/a-critique-of-science-and-karl-poppers-swan-induction.-marcio-alexandre-afonso-polizelli', 'internet-archive:a-critique-of-science-and-karl-poppers-swan-induction.-marcio-alexandre-afonso-polizelli'),
