  ('622695347066987375', 'A Man with Purpose: The Rupert Brooke Story: Special Edition (2026)', 'Nancy Hanks Lincoln Public Library', 2026, 'History', 'A memoir about Rupert Brooke as well as his own letters focusing on his travels to Canada and the United States from digitally restored page image scans of the original 1918 and 1916 editions. Enhanced 2026 edition. This book is copyrighted. Material is not public domain. This is a reading copy only. High resolution version available in trade paperback print format. For print copies please visit online retailers such as Barnes and Noble or Books-a-Million . Both sites offer bulk discount of single titles for schools, colleges, universities and public libraries. Or contact Standish Press at www.standishpress.com', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-man-with-purpose-the-rupert-brooke-story-special-edition-2026-display-book-version', 'https://archive.org/details/a-man-with-purpose-the-rupert-brooke-story-special-edition-2026-display-book-version', 'internet-archive:a-man-with-purpose-the-rupert-brooke-story-special-edition-2026-display-book-version'),
