  ('776755292428351901', 'A World Built On False Science A Bio-electric Twin Theory Of Life', 'Ben & Daniel Griffiths', 2025, 'Science', 'In a world built on false science and biochemical illusions, a hidden truth emerges: the human body is not a chemical machine, but a living, breathing bioelectrical field. This book tears apart outdated dogmas and rebuilds a unified theory of life based on energy, vibration, and the intelligence of Microzyma. Drawing from suppressed discoveries, ancient wisdom, and modern observations, it reveals the heart’s true power, the liver’s electrical transformations, and the brain’s luminous dance of light and thought. It is time to reclaim health, vitality, and sovereignty — not through pills or profit, but through the forgotten frequencies of life itself. This is the future of health. This is the return to truth.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-world-built-on-false-science-a-unified-twin-theory-of-life', 'https://archive.org/details/a-world-built-on-false-science-a-unified-twin-theory-of-life', 'internet-archive:a-world-built-on-false-science-a-unified-twin-theory-of-life'),
