  ('397611747790499847', 'Ain ul Faqr - Urdu Translation with Persian Text', 'Author: Sultan ul Arifeen Hazrat Sakhi Sultan Bahoo, Translator: Hafiz Hammad ur Rehman Sarwari Qadri', 2020, 'Literature', 'Ain-ul-Faqr (Urdu Translation with Persian Text) is the most popular book by the eminent Saint of Sub-continent Sultan ul Arifeen Hazrat Sakhi Sultan Bahoo . This subtle book contains spiritual lessons for all the common and special seekers of Allah whether they are at initial, middle or final level of Faqr. Sultan Bahoo wrote almost 140 books which are full of Divine Secrets and which are true guide for seekers of Allah. To purchase books call on the following numbers; +924235436600, +923224722766 Or visit https://sultan-ul-faqr-publications.com', 'https://archive.org/services/img/ainulfaqr_202004', 'https://archive.org/details/ainulfaqr_202004', 'internet-archive:ainulfaqr_202004'),
