  ('819702930709150940', 'Aliens', 'Mark Verheiden', 1990, 'Graphic Novel', 'Aliens by Mark Verheiden. A graphic novel book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1693068W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL1693068W-'),
  ('1068358971423359282', 'Aliens', 'Mark Verheiden', 1990, 'Graphic Novel', 'Aliens by Mark Verheiden', 'https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/4835393-L.jpg', 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1693068W', 'internet-archive:ol-works-OL1693068W'),
  ('955184796597061057', 'Aliens Omnibus - Volume 1', 'Dark Horse Comics', 2007, 'Science Fiction', 'Dark Horse Comics took the industry by storm with its release of Aliens , a comics series that for the first time captured the power of film source material and expanded its universe in a way that fans applauded worldwide. Now, the first three Dark Horse Aliens series- Outbreak , Nightmare Asylum , and Female War -are collected in a value-priced, quality-format omnibus, featuring nearly four hundred story pages in full color. Written by screen and television scribe Mark Verheiden ( The Mask, Battlestar Gallactica) and illustrated with consummate skill by Mark A. Nelson, Den Beauvais, and Sam Kieth, Aliens Omnibus Vol. 1 is an essential piece of the Aliens mythos and a great entry point into the storied Dark Horse Aliens library.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/AliensOmnibusVolume1', 'https://archive.org/details/AliensOmnibusVolume1', 'internet-archive:AliensOmnibusVolume1'),
  ('540782452404338647', 'Alîyê Pêncem - الطرف الخامس', 'Ibrahim Haidar', 2026, 'Literature', '​ [بالعربية]: كتاب يجمع بين النصوص الأدبية والوجدانية، يتناول قضايا الهوية والانتماء. يطرح الكاتب رؤية فلسفية حول كون اللغة أداة للتعبير وليست مقياساً للهوية، مستعرضاً علاقة الإنسان بوطنه وذاته من خلال الذاكرة والحنين. ​ [Kurmancî]: Pirtûka "Alîyê Pêncem" berhemeke wêjeyî û felsefî ye. Nivîskar Îbrahîm Heyder tê de li ser têgehên nasname, welatparêzî û bîranînan disakine. Ew balê dikişîne ser ku ziman amûrek e ji bo îfadeyê, ne pîvana nasnameyê ye.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/aliye-pencem', 'https://archive.org/details/aliye-pencem', 'internet-archive:aliye-pencem'),
