  ('963739474964303264', 'anglo-bengali-christians-in-bangladesh -identity-history-and-community-context.book(1)', 'Prof. Dr. Milton Biswas', 2026, 'History', 'This scholarly work examines the historical formation, identity, and socio-cultural evolution of the Anglo-Bengali Christian community in Bangladesh. Drawing on archival sources and interdisciplinary analysis, the book explores minority identity, colonial modernity, and cultural transformation in South Asia. https://greatinliterature.com/anglo-bengali-christians-in-bangladesh/', 'https://archive.org/services/img/anglo-bengali-christians-in-bangladesh_-identity-history-and-community-context.book1', 'https://archive.org/details/anglo-bengali-christians-in-bangladesh_-identity-history-and-community-context.book1', 'internet-archive:anglo-bengali-christians-in-bangladesh_-identity-history-and-community-context.book1'),
