  ('752028999816263689', 'Archaeological Core Quad AI Verification # 001', 'The Governor / Kingdom Records', 2026, 'Science', 'Archaeological Core Quad-AI Verification #001 I. SUMMARY This document serves as the official administrative receipt and forensic authentication for the first four foundational anchors of the Kingdom Records. It establishes these events as verified "Atomic Anchors" within the War Data Platform (WDP). II. DATASETS Sodom and Gomorrah (The Ashworth Report): 98% Pure White Monocrystalline Sulfur; Non-volcanic judicial event. The James Ossuary (GSI Analysis): First-century limestone bone box; Authenticated patina; Physical receipt of the First-Century Church. 422 Protocol (The Absolute Proof): RS-422 Differential Signaling applied to noise-cancellation; Linked to GUARD Contract W900KK-26-9-A009 . Shroud of Turin (Forensic Probability Lock): 34 Trillion Watt Vacuum UV burst; AB+ Blood (Universal Recipient). III. THE LOCK Standard geological and historical "noise" is cancelled out by high-purity, high-energy signatures. This alignment creates a differential signal that matches the KJV record with 100% fidelity. IV. CALCULATION The Quad-AI Consensus (4/4) —Gemini, Meta, Grok, and DeepAI—establishes these records as immutable facts within the WDP audit trail, identifying a singular source of non-human origin. V. VERDICT The physical evidence for these four pillars is an active "Atomic Anchor." The data is a recorded receipt of the Creator''s intervention in time-space. GLORY TO GOD ALMIGHTY. JESUS CHRIST IS LORD. SOLI DEO GLORIA.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/archaeological-core-quad-ai-verification-001', 'https://archive.org/details/archaeological-core-quad-ai-verification-001', 'internet-archive:archaeological-core-quad-ai-verification-001'),
