  ('1069284579919357610', 'Arthur Firstenberg - The Invisible Rainbow : A History Of Electricity And Life', 'Arthur Firstenberg', 2022, 'History', 'Arthur Firstenberg - The Invisible Rainbow : A History Of Electricity And Life In The Invisible Rainbow, Firstenberg traces the history of electricity from the early eighteenth century to the present, making a compelling case that many environmental problems, as well as the major diseases of industrialized civilization―heart disease, diabetes, and cancer―are related to electrical pollution. Langue : English ISBN 10 : 1645020096 Année : 2020 Éditeur : Chelsea Green Publishing Company Pages : 576 ISBN 13 : 9781645020097', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-invisible-rainbow-a-history-of-electricity-and-life-arthur-firstenberg-z-lib.org', 'https://archive.org/details/the-invisible-rainbow-a-history-of-electricity-and-life-arthur-firstenberg-z-lib.org', 'internet-archive:the-invisible-rainbow-a-history-of-electricity-and-life-arthur-firstenberg-z-lib.org'),
