  ('998629343754883475', 'Assassin''s Creed Graphic novels, comics, manga (anthology) 2007-2025', 'multiple authors', 2024, 'History', 'A fullest collection of all graphical novels and/or comics set in Assassin''s Creed universe available by date. Note not all of them are canon unlike games'' official novelization https://archive.org/details/assassins-creed-novels-anthology . Majority of books is in .cbr which should work fine in archive org. Some are in .pdf. Download attached program Calibre from the above link to open .cbr on PC. Most recent books: - ''AC'' Mirage - A Soar of Eagles 03 2025 - ''AC'' Mirage - A Soar of Eagles 01-02 2025 - The Hidden Codex 2024 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Valhalla_%E2%80%93_The_Hidden_Codex - Assassin''s Creed: Dynasty 2021-2023 vol. 1 - 5 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Dynasty - Assassin''s Creed: Bloodstone 2022 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Bloodstone Not yet added/found: - Assassin''s Creed (webcomic) 2007 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed_(webcomic) - Assassin''s Creed: Visionaries 2023 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Visionaries - Assassin''s Creed: Mirage – A Soar of Eagles 2024-2025 (1, 2, 3) https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Mirage_%E2%80%93_A_Soar_of_Eagles - Assassin''s Creed: Forgotten Temple 2023 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Forgotten_Temple If you know other available AC comics, novels or manga please e-mail us.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/assassins-creed-graphic-novels-and-comics-anthology', 'https://archive.org/details/assassins-creed-graphic-novels-and-comics-anthology', 'internet-archive:assassins-creed-graphic-novels-and-comics-anthology'),
  ('776535571675148929', 'Assassin''s Creed Novels (anthology) 2009-2023', '''Oliver Bowden'', multiple authors', 2023, 'History', 'A collection of all text books in Assassin''s Creed universe available by date. It consists of novelization books (expanded official canon lore) (almost all of them) and several additional books which tell the story of new characters in the same time setting as one or more games (Heresy, Last Descendants trilogy and The Engine of History trilogy). All books made into .pdf, if you feel like using .mobi format on PC, download attached program Calibre. Most recent items: - Assassin''s Creed: Valhalla – Sword of the White Horse 2022 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Valhalla_%E2%80%93_Sword_of_the_White_Horse - Assassin''s Creed: The Golden City 2023 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_The_Golden_City Not added yet: - Assassin''s Creed: The Imperial Jade Seal 2022 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_The_Imperial_Jade_Seal - Assassin''s Creed: The Silk Road 2021 https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_The_Silk_Road - Assassin''s Creed Fragments (3) the Witches of the Moors 2024; https://assassinscreed.fandom.com/wiki/Assassin%27s_Creed:_Fragments_%E2%80%93_The_Witches_of_the_Moors - TBA third book in The Engine of History trilogy. - TBA AC Shadows book.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/assassins-creed-novels-anthology', 'https://archive.org/details/assassins-creed-novels-anthology', 'internet-archive:assassins-creed-novels-anthology'),
