  ('843186640368647441', 'Autobiographical Statement — Eugene Khutoryansky', 'Eugene Khutoryansky', 2026, 'Biography', 'This item contains a first-person autobiographical statement written by Eugene Khutoryansky in 2026. The document describes the author’s background, philosophical views on objective morality, ethical veganism and animal rights activism, and his work creating educational physics videos. It is intended to provide biographical and philosophical context for the author’s writings and educational work.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/about_eugene_khutoryansky', 'https://archive.org/details/about_eugene_khutoryansky', 'internet-archive:about_eugene_khutoryansky'),
