  ('212516697320078791', 'Azot Temelli Amonyak Biyokimyası (Ansiklopedi)', 'Sahne Dünya', 2026, 'Science', 'Do you think life is just about oxygen and water? If you think so, you''re wrong, because biology is more diverse than you imagine! There''s such a thing as alternative biochemistry, which makes it much more flexible! Don''t just see ammonia as a cleaning agent; it''s chemically very similar to water! In fact, it''s a favorite in cold climates! How? Read the PDF for details!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/azot-temelli-amonyak-biyokimyasi-ansikopedi', 'https://archive.org/details/azot-temelli-amonyak-biyokimyasi-ansikopedi', 'internet-archive:azot-temelli-amonyak-biyokimyasi-ansikopedi'),
