  ('697040157537197632', 'Before the Coffee Gets Cold', 'Toshikazu Kawaguchi', 2015, 'Literature', 'Before the Coffee Gets Cold is a 2015 novel by Toshikazu Kawaguchi. It tells of a café in Tokyo that allows its customers to travel back in time, as long as they return before their coffee gets cold.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/before-the-coffee-gets-cold-9781529029598', 'https://archive.org/details/before-the-coffee-gets-cold-9781529029598', 'internet-archive:before-the-coffee-gets-cold-9781529029598'),
