  ('298391784933807698', 'Berkshire Hathaway 2025 Annual Report', 'Berkshire Hathaway', 2026, 'History', 'The 2025 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for Berkshire Hathaway (Ticker: BRKA & BRKB). The company is a holding company based in Omaha, Nebraska with business lines in Insurance, Railroads, Utilities & Energy, Manufacturing & retail. The company was founded in 1839 as a textile manufacturer. In 1965, under the management of CEO and chairman Warren Buffett, the company transitioned into a diversified holding company.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/berkshire-hathaway-brk-annual-report-2024', 'https://archive.org/details/berkshire-hathaway-brk-annual-report-2024', 'internet-archive:berkshire-hathaway-brk-annual-report-2024'),
