  ('1024577569782791313', 'Bibliography Gujarati Children Literature', 'Unknown', 2025, 'Literature', 'Dr. Urjita Patel edited and compiled ‘Vadmayasoochi: Gujarati Children’s Literature’ includes the possible Vadmayasoochi details of a total of 6249 books published from 1881 to 2013. The collections of which have been made according to AACR 2. This list has been prepared by dividing it into 17 main subjects, such as history, art, poetry, mathematics, stories, education and its sub-subjects. At the end of the section of subject-based main collections, under the Author List, the books included by the Author have been arranged in alphabetical order against the name of each Author and the serial number of each book has been shown against it, while in the title (work) list, the name of the Author and the serial number have been shown against each title. At the beginning of the present list, a trade agreement has been given for the purpose of using the list.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/bibliography-gujarati-children-literature', 'https://archive.org/details/bibliography-gujarati-children-literature', 'internet-archive:bibliography-gujarati-children-literature'),
