  ('941591398707531818', 'Bok Of Vril', '14-88', 2025, 'Science', 'This is a work of art. A beauteous specimen of the Aryan Spirit. It is neither pictographic, nor expressive of an escape from the condition that is Man. It is meant for the Higher minds among the living, the compatriots and comrades of Well-Being, and mostly, for the innovators of Humankind which have served as the balance between survival and extinction for millennium. The White Aryan Himself.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/bok-of-vril', 'https://archive.org/details/bok-of-vril', 'internet-archive:bok-of-vril'),
