  ('1007811463545132622', 'Buffalo Orphan Asylum Volumes: A Guide', 'The Buffalo History Museum', 2025, 'History', 'The Buffalo (N.Y.) Orphan Asylum records were donated to us in 1982. Staff then typed up index cards for some of the children served, about 16,000 names from volumes dated about 1882 to 1939 . This guide indicates which volumes are and are not indexed. Here is an updated Google Doc version of this guide with clickable links .', 'https://archive.org/services/img/buffalo-orphan-asylum-index-volumes', 'https://archive.org/details/buffalo-orphan-asylum-index-volumes', 'internet-archive:buffalo-orphan-asylum-index-volumes'),
