  ('1067344796935470542', 'Calling CQ - Adventures of Short-Wave Radio Operators', 'DeSoto W9KL, Patton NG3P, Witkowski W6DTW', 2009, 'History', 'This book was written by Clinton B. DeSoto (1912 - 1949, amateur radio callsign W9KL) and published in 1941. Gwendolyn Patton (NG3P) endeavored to compile a complete copy of the book for preservation, and in 1999 with the help of Peter Pegrume (G3GHA) and Sydney Pegrume (FK5CR) the project was completed and a copy of the book was hosted on www.qsl.net via NG3P''s personal page at http://www.qsl.net/ng3p/ in HTML format. PDF creation (assembly, table of contents, etc) and archive posting was done by David Witkowski (W6DTW).', 'https://archive.org/services/img/CallingCq-AdventureOfShort-waveRadioOperators', 'https://archive.org/details/CallingCq-AdventureOfShort-waveRadioOperators', 'internet-archive:CallingCq-AdventureOfShort-waveRadioOperators'),
