  ('107488378472550826', 'Capital One Financial Corp 2025 Annual Report', 'Capital One Financial Corp.', 2026, 'History', 'The 2025 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for Capital One Financial Corp. (Ticker: COF). The company is an American bank holding company that is the largest issuer of credit cards in the United States while also operating in the UK and Canada. After a 2025 acquisition it also operates Discover Bank, The Discover and Pulse networks and owns Diners Club International. Founded in 1994 after a corporate spinoff from Signet Financial, the company went public in October 1994. The company is headquartered in Tysons, Virginia.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/capital-one-financial-corp-cof-annual-report-2025', 'https://archive.org/details/capital-one-financial-corp-cof-annual-report-2025', 'internet-archive:capital-one-financial-corp-cof-annual-report-2025'),
