  ('456547111378880822', 'Case No. 25-cv-2597', 'Democracy Forward Foundation', 2025, 'History', 'Democracy Forward Foundation v. U.S. Department of Justice & Federal Bureau of Investigation ▪ The Democracy Forward Foundation , in a first-of-its-kind federally filed lawsuit, is suing Trump''s DOJ & FBI - to force the U.S. Government to release of the complete Epstein Files - including the “ client list ” and any and all memos and documents Pam Bondi reviewed to brief Trump . "Plaintiff Democracy Forward Foundation brings this action against Defendants U.S. Department of Justice ( DOJ ) and the Federal Bureau of Investigation ( FBI ) to compel compliance with the Freedom of Information Act, 5 U.S.C. § 552 ( FOIA )." ▪ This pending lawsuit was filed in the U.S. District Court in the District of Columbia on August 8th, 2025.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/case-no.-25-cv-2597-08-08-2025', 'https://archive.org/details/case-no.-25-cv-2597-08-08-2025', 'internet-archive:case-no.-25-cv-2597-08-08-2025'),
