  ('538324906061705059', 'Caterpillar 2024 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'Caterpillar', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for Caterpillar, Inc. (Ticker: CAT). The company manufactures construction, mining and farm equipment in addition to engines, industrial turbines and locomotives under the CAT brand. The company, founded in 1925, was headquartered in Peoria, Illinois until moving in 2022 to Irving, Texas. The company listed on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) on December 2, 1929.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/02-caterpillar-cat-annual-report-2024', 'https://archive.org/details/02-caterpillar-cat-annual-report-2024', 'internet-archive:02-caterpillar-cat-annual-report-2024'),
