  ('286145189308215655', 'Chowallur Siva Temple, Guruvayoor, Kerala Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'This small ebook provides information about the ancient Chowallur Siva Temple, located near the famous Guruvayur Sri Krishna Temple in Thrissur district, Kerala, India. The booklet includes details about: • Location and how to reach • Temple history and legends • Spiritual significance • Architecture of the temple • Main deity and sub-deities • Daily poojas and special rituals • Festivals celebrated in the temple • Facilities for devotees • Nearby temples and tourist attractions • Nearby accommodation options This ebook is part of a series of free temple information booklets prepared to promote awareness about sacred places of worship in India. The ebook is shared free for educational and spiritual purposes. Author: Thirumaleshwar Muliya', 'https://archive.org/services/img/chowallur-siva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/chowallur-siva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed', 'internet-archive:chowallur-siva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed'),
