  ('913985070209014727', 'Cigar Shaped Spacecraft Coming In Earth Alliance Disclosure Plan', 'Michael Salla, JP', 2025, 'History', 'On December 14, 2024, a retired US Army serviceman, JP , was taken to an underground facility in Tampa, Florida, where he was exposed to three cigar-shaped spacecraft that are included among many that are about to be revealed to the general public by ‘White Hats’ in the US military and other national military forces that make up the “Earth Alliance.” The craft will be the next phase in the release of advanced transmedium spacecraft, aka drones, currently being witnessed in the US and worldwide. In his update, JP describes the size of the cigar-shaped craft he witnessed in their Florida hanger, and how they can easily camouflage themselves by using a stealth technology that mimics the surrounding environment. JP describes the plan to launch the spacecraft and allow them to be witnessed, thereby gradually psychologically preparing the general public for the larger and larger craft that will be unveiled in the months ahead. JP was told the release of these medium-sized cigar-shaped spacecraft was part of an unfolding disclosure plan.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cigar-shaped-spacecraft-coming-in-earth-alliance-disclosure-plan-michael-salla-jp', 'https://archive.org/details/cigar-shaped-spacecraft-coming-in-earth-alliance-disclosure-plan-michael-salla-jp', 'internet-archive:cigar-shaped-spacecraft-coming-in-earth-alliance-disclosure-plan-michael-salla-jp'),
  ('330473703563408473', 'Cincinnati Reds 2025 Media Guide', 'Cincinnati Reds', 2025, 'History', 'A media guide produced by the Cincinnati Reds in preparation for the 2025 Major League Baseball (MLB) season. This edition, the 156th in the team''s history, gave historical statistics and information on the Reds club that was led by Manager Terry Francona.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cincinnati-reds-2025-media-guide-c', 'https://archive.org/details/cincinnati-reds-2025-media-guide-c', 'internet-archive:cincinnati-reds-2025-media-guide-c'),
