  ('627998245035400507', 'Cleveland Guardians 2025 Media Guide', 'Cleveland Indians', 2025, 'History', 'A media guide produced by the Cleveland Guardians in preparation for the 2025 Major League Baseball (MLB) season. This edition, the 125th in the team''s history, gave historical statistics and information on the Guardians club that was led by Manager Stephen Vogt. The ballclub changed their mascot to become the Cleveland Guardians beginning with the 2022 season after being known as the Cleveland Indians since 1915.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cleveland-guardians-2025-media-guide-c', 'https://archive.org/details/cleveland-guardians-2025-media-guide-c', 'internet-archive:cleveland-guardians-2025-media-guide-c'),
