  ('1012642270248843813', 'Cold Fusion A Comprehensive And Complete Blueprint To End Energy Scarcit', 'Heidilin Bertz', 2025, 'Science', 'PHOENIX PROTOCOLS: A Framework for Energy Independence. Open Source Research for the Public Trust. This document is a theoretical framework and opensource research proposal released for educational and humanitarian purposes. It is not a solicitation for investment.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cold-fusion-a-comprehensive-and-complete-blueprint-to-end-energy-scarcity', 'https://archive.org/details/cold-fusion-a-comprehensive-and-complete-blueprint-to-end-energy-scarcity', 'internet-archive:cold-fusion-a-comprehensive-and-complete-blueprint-to-end-energy-scarcity'),
  ('1054307642120002030', 'Cold Mother', 'Peter Siegfried Krug', 2026, 'History', 'English: This document provides a deep psychological and biographical analysis of the "Cold Mother" construct. It explores how maternal emotional unavailability—often rooted in transgenerational trauma such as the "Verdingkind" (contract child) system or wartime experiences—affects the child''s Ego development. By comparing the maternal backgrounds of figures like Franz Josef Stangl, Robert Volek, and Herta Brigitte Bertel (1943–2024), the text illustrates the mechanisms of "emotional petrification" and the failure of dialogue. This work is part of a larger mission to document and process institutional abuse and its long-term impact on families. Deutsch (Erläuterung): Diese Analyse beleuchtet das Ich-Konstrukt der „kalten Mutter“ und die transgenerationale Weitergabe von Traumata. Im Fokus steht die Aufarbeitung von Missbrauchserfahrungen (Heimerziehung/Verdingkinder) und deren Auswirkungen auf die Bindungsfähigkeit. Ein zentraler Bestandteil meiner Dokumentationspflicht.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cold-mother', 'https://archive.org/details/cold-mother', 'internet-archive:cold-mother'),
