  ('1083896377711934416', 'Collection of Ideas DARPA Didn''t Want', 'Simon Edwards', 2023, 'Science', 'This collection consists of novel, open-source hypotheses in physics, medicine, engineering, astronomy, cosmology and other topics. It will be amended as new content is created. While some of this content would have to be considered to constitute per se inventions by any objective observer, I have not been able to afford patent protection for my ideas and have made it my custom to share my ideas freely as this state of affairs is unlikely to change in the United States. Thus, none are legally inventions and are thus impervious to certain regulations. This type of information is remarkably difficult to come across as the administrators of nearly every site at which I''ve tried to share this content have promptly removed it despite it being nothing but my own earnestly held beliefs about science and what direction our research might take. None of it is owned by anyone. None of it is National Defense Information nor may it be regulated in any way. This has not stopped unknown individuals within the American government from coercing a number of sysadmins into removing the content. In one recent notable example, the LiveScience forums were permanently closed and its contents erased (May 1, 2024.) This content had been hosted in their astronomy subforum prior to that time. It is not clear if they received a National Security Letter. I have received no direct request to desist in my activities, which consist of nothing more than sharing my own hypotheses in physics. I do not believe that this activity should be officially or unofficially prohibited or disrupted in any fashion and any attempt to do as much is not becoming of the government a supposedly free nation. I sincerely hope that someone in a position to do something with this information will perform experimental verification of the theory and will share the information as broadly as possible. It may surprise you to learn that I do not hold a university degree and taught myself about physics. If anyone has any questions, technical or personal, I can be reached by E-Mail at my archive.org user name at gee male.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/Collection_of_Ideas_DARPA_Didnt_Want', 'https://archive.org/details/Collection_of_Ideas_DARPA_Didnt_Want', 'internet-archive:Collection_of_Ideas_DARPA_Didnt_Want'),
