  ('469019953088858295', 'Comics Research Bibliography 2025 & Addenda combined e-book edition', 'Mike Rhode, John A. Lent, Tony R. Rose', 2026, 'History', '30th Anniversary Edition, in honor of John A. Lent''s 90th birth year, updated with 3,327 new entries . An addenda of 2000 more pages of unsorted citations is at https://archive.org/details/crb-2025-addendum A worldwide bibliography of all types of comic art, including comic books, comic strips, caricature, gag cartoons, animation, editorial cartoons, biography, webcomics, political cartoons, history of cartooning, and comics scholarship. The Addenda pages of citations have been formatted but not yet placed into the CRB. Many of them are from the first online iteration of the CRB, now preserved on the Internet Archive. For our 30th Anniversary and in honor of John Lent’s 90th birth year, we are providing these as a resource the first time, since they are searchable by keyword. However, the goal remains to empty this document by placing all the citations into the main bibliography which is online now at Comics Research Bibliography 2025.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/crb-2025-ebook-and-addenda-combined-edition', 'https://archive.org/details/crb-2025-ebook-and-addenda-combined-edition', 'internet-archive:crb-2025-ebook-and-addenda-combined-edition'),
  ('906186764507564122', 'Comics Research Bibliography 2025 e-book edition Addendum', 'Mike Rhode, John A. Lent, Tony R. Rose', 2026, 'History', 'These pages of citations have been formatted but not yet placed into the CRB. Many of them are from the first online iteration of the CRB, now preserved on the Internet Archive. For our 30th Anniversary and in honor of John Lent’s 90th birth year, we are providing these as a resource the first time, since they are searchable by keyword. However, the goal remains to empty this document by placing all the citations into the main bibliography which is online now at Comics Research Bibliography 2025.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/crb-2025-addendum', 'https://archive.org/details/crb-2025-addendum', 'internet-archive:crb-2025-addendum'),
