  ('496588465087976327', 'Compilation | 2023-2025 | Animal Welfare Discussion-The Smidge Problem', 'Anatole Ternaux', 2026, 'Literature', 'Compiled by Anatole Ternaux. Claims compiled from TikTok, Twitter, and other posts by Winter regarding his service dog -- Smidge -- the fundraising, his self-claimed flight to Finland, and EU regulations. For additional commentary and details, refer to P:art 8 of Seoulmama''s essays on Winter . Also see Ternaux''s essay on the same subject: Where is the DOG? Part II .', 'https://archive.org/services/img/compilation-2023-2025-animal-welfare-discussion', 'https://archive.org/details/compilation-2023-2025-animal-welfare-discussion', 'internet-archive:compilation-2023-2025-animal-welfare-discussion'),
  ('793273110359624876', 'Compilation | 2025-2026 | World Of Gardian LLC Organization', 'Anatole Ternaux', 2026, 'Literature', 'World of Gardian LLC organization documents - personally identifying information has been redacted', 'https://archive.org/services/img/compilation-2025-2026-world-of-gardian-llc-organization', 'https://archive.org/details/compilation-2025-2026-world-of-gardian-llc-organization', 'internet-archive:compilation-2025-2026-world-of-gardian-llc-organization'),
  ('121961570529886127', 'Compilation | 20260220 | Cancellation Announcement and Website Changes', 'Anatole Ternaux', 2026, 'Literature', 'Compilation includes: Initial announcement of the cancellation of Age of Scorpius v. 2 on Patreon. Changes to the World of Guardian website post-cancellation. Click to see original website prior to changes archived here . A comment from Bug, an artist on the WOG team, original location found on the Patreon cancellation announcement.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/patreon-20260220-long-awaited-changes-signed', 'https://archive.org/details/patreon-20260220-long-awaited-changes-signed', 'internet-archive:patreon-20260220-long-awaited-changes-signed'),
  ('708594451081388141', 'Compilation | Book Reviews and Product Pages', 'Anatole Ternaux', 2026, 'Literature', 'PDF captures of product pages and reviews for The Age of Scorpius and Alterlife , the first published under the pen name "Audra Winter," and the second under "Milo Prather." Goodreads, Fable, StoryGraph, and Amazon, PDFs captured between 17 February and 20 February 2026.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/goodreads-age-of-scorpius-2026-02-20-snapshot', 'https://archive.org/details/goodreads-age-of-scorpius-2026-02-20-snapshot', 'internet-archive:goodreads-age-of-scorpius-2026-02-20-snapshot'),
  ('279660614818062631', 'Compilation of Pankaj Oudhia’s work on Medicinal Rice Research', 'Pankaj Oudhia', 2014, 'Science', 'Compilation of Pankaj Oudhia’s work on Medicinal Rice Research Fortunately I live and work in the region where Rice (Oryza sativa) originated. There are thousands of Rice types in nature in this region i.e. Chhattisgarh. In Rice Germplasm bank of Indira Gandhi Agricultural University, Raipur there are over 23,000 types of Rice. As researcher in this university in year 2000 I published a research note on use of Rice as Medicine. Das, G. K., and P. Oudhia."Rice as a medicinal plant in Chhattisgarh, India." Plant Genetic Resources Newsletter 122(2000). Rice Publications by Pankaj Oudhia – Google Scholar results http://scholar.google.com/scholar?hl=en&q=rice+oudhia&btnG= # This reference has been widely quoted in all the publications on Medicinal Rice around the world. Later I published many papers on different aspects of Medicinal Rice but paper publication in journals has its own limitations. It forced me to present the vast Traditional Medicinal Knowledge about Medicinal Rice not only in Chhattisgarh but in different parts of India and even neighboring countries like Sri Lanka, Nepal through online publications like archive.org Keep visiting this page at Archive.org for updates.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/PankajOudhiaOnMedicinalRice', 'https://archive.org/details/PankajOudhiaOnMedicinalRice', 'internet-archive:PankajOudhiaOnMedicinalRice'),
  ('1017605070351280169', 'Complete Archive of My Facebook Posts Up to 26th January 2026 by Nuwan Wijayaweera', 'Nuwan Wijayaweera', 2026, 'Literature', 'This repository contains a complete backup of all my Facebook posts in HTML format, covering the period from the beginning of my activity on the platform through 26 January 2026. To ensure proper functionality and full access to associated content, please also download the media.zip file and extract it into a folder named media , placed in the same directory as the HTML file. This material is being made publicly available for the purposes of open access, documentation, and long-term preservation. It may be accessed, read, and referenced freely by anyone. The content is provided in its original form and reflects the context and views at the time of posting.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/all-my-facebook-posts-upto-26th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera', 'https://archive.org/details/all-my-facebook-posts-upto-26th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera', 'internet-archive:all-my-facebook-posts-upto-26th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera'),
  ('627314340832795739', 'Complete Archive of My Twitter Posts Up to 27th January 2026 by Nuwan Wijayaweera', 'Nuwan Wijayaweera', 2026, 'Literature', 'This repository contains a complete backup of all my Twitter posts in HTML format, covering the period from the beginning of my activity on the platform through 27 January 2026. To ensure proper functionality and full access to associated content, please also download the tweets_media.zip file and extract it into a folder named tweets_media , placed in the same directory as the HTML file. This material is being made publicly available for the purposes of open access, documentation, and long-term preservation. It may be accessed, read, and referenced freely by anyone. The content is provided in its original form and reflects the context and views at the time of posting.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/all-my-twitter-posts-upto-27th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera', 'https://archive.org/details/all-my-twitter-posts-upto-27th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera', 'internet-archive:all-my-twitter-posts-upto-27th-january-2026-nuwan-wijayaweera'),
