  ('1078466159345025158', 'Comprehensive Academic, Professional Development, and Skill Certification Portfolio (Law, Forensic Science, Constitutional Studies, ICT & Interdisciplinary Training)', 'GANESH SHRIRANG SATARKAR', 2026, 'Science', 'Ganesh Shrirang Nale Satarkar , an academic and legal professional, has successfully completed and participated in a wide range of certificate courses, faculty development programmes (FDPs), workshops, merit-based academic achievements, skill certifications, and national/international training programmes conducted by Universities, National Law Universities, Government bodies, AICTE, IEEE, WHO, ICPS, ATAL Academy, ICAI, and reputed academic institutions . These certifications span Medical Jurisprudence and Forensic Science, Constitutional Law, Parliamentary Studies, Intellectual Property Rights, Cyber-Physical Systems, Information Technology, Full Stack Engineering, Research Methodology, Teaching–Learning Pedagogy, Language Proficiency (Rashtrabhasha & Marathi), Space Law, Migration Studies, COVID-19 Public Health Response, and Digital & Legal Capacity Building . The portfolio reflects merit positions, national-level recognitions, interdisciplinary expertise, continuous professional development, and engagement with contemporary legal, technological, forensic, and governance-oriented academic frameworks , contributing to teaching, research, and policy-oriented scholarship.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/comprehensive-academic-professional-development-and-skill-certification-portfo', 'https://archive.org/details/comprehensive-academic-professional-development-and-skill-certification-portfo', 'internet-archive:comprehensive-academic-professional-development-and-skill-certification-portfo'),
