  ('152470999032861101', 'Death Of Nadina Cenci', 'SoloFumetto', 2026, 'Mystery', '“Nadina’s Diary” is the spin-off of the novel The Girl at the Door. It is an intense and moving tale revealed through the pages of a secret diary, where emotions and memories resurface with force. A mother, driven by the need to understand and to rebuild a lost bond, immerses herself in those words in search of answers and hidden truths. A story that weaves together pain and hope, capable of engaging and touching the reader from the very first page.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/death-of-nadina-cenci', 'https://archive.org/details/death-of-nadina-cenci', 'internet-archive:death-of-nadina-cenci'),
