  ('78320974322504726', 'Devji Maharaj Temple, Malajpur, Madhya Pradesh Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'Title: Devji Maharaj Temple – Morena District, Madhya Pradesh Description: This illustrated PDF provides a concise introduction to Devji Maharaj Temple located in Jamalpur village in Morena district of Madhya Pradesh, India. The temple is dedicated to the revered saint Devji Maharaj, who is believed to bless devotees with spiritual healing and protection. The document includes information about the temple’s location, history, legends, architecture, deities, rituals, festivals, facilities for devotees, nearby temples, and other useful details for pilgrims and readers interested in Indian temple heritage and spiritual traditions.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/devji-maharaj-temple-malajpur-madhya-pradesh-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/devji-maharaj-temple-malajpur-madhya-pradesh-compressed', 'internet-archive:devji-maharaj-temple-malajpur-madhya-pradesh-compressed'),
