  ('195344443126816800', 'Discover Britain’s Glorious Heritage', 'National Trust Tours.', 2026, 'History', 'Discover Britain’s Glorious Heritage; 2026 Departures Brochure. National Trust for Historic Preservation, 105 Loudoun Street, SW Unit 1, Leesburg, VA 20175. www.nationaltrusttours.com Meg Annacone-Poretz; Director, National Trust Tours. The Royal Oak Foundation seeks to raise awareness of and advance the work of the Na onal Trust of England, Wales and Northern Ireland by inspiring support from the United States for the Trust’s efforts to preserve and protect historic places and spaces. Albion Journeys has been working with Royal Oak since 2013. 36 pages.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/discover-britains-glorious-heritage', 'https://archive.org/details/discover-britains-glorious-heritage', 'internet-archive:discover-britains-glorious-heritage'),
