  ('386782732179050466', 'Divine Light Of The Most Merciful - انوارالرحمٰن', 'His Holiness, Hazrat Baba Albeyle Shah Yousufi (ra)', 2025, 'Biography', 'This Booklet is a meticulous Summary of the Biographical Account of Hazrat Sufi Abdur Rahman Shah Sahib (ra), in the Book, Anwaar-ur-Rahman Al Tanveer-ul-Jinan . The original Biography is in Farsi (Persian) and this Summary has been dictated by our Grand Sufi Master Sarkar Aala Hazrat, Hazrat Albeyle Shah Yousufi (ra) in Urdu, which has been further translated into English by me, as requested by our Sheikh, Hazrat Baba Shah Mehmood Yousufi (ra) to help bridge the linguistic and contextual gaps.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/divine-light-of-the-most-merciful-', 'https://archive.org/details/divine-light-of-the-most-merciful-', 'internet-archive:divine-light-of-the-most-merciful-'),
