  ('207787752629653025', 'Documents on Diplomacy: Primary Source Documents and Lessons from the World of Foreign Affairs', 'U.S. Department of State, Office of the Historian', 2011, 'History', 'This is a copy of the contents of the two CD-ROM discs from the project, "Documents on Diplomacy: Primary Source Documents and Lessons from the World of Foreign Affars 1775-2011." They were created and distributed by the U.S. Department of State in 2011 to celebrate the agency''s 150th anniversary. According to the project''s liner notes, the discs are intended for use by "secondary school teachers and their students", and contain "more than 300 primary source documents, paired with classroom-ready lessons, covering key events from 1775 to 2011: lessons that use art, music, dance and drama."', 'https://archive.org/services/img/Documents-On-Diplomacy', 'https://archive.org/details/Documents-On-Diplomacy', 'internet-archive:Documents-On-Diplomacy'),
  ('1139710699965390980', 'DocuSign 2025 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'Docusign, Inc.', 2025, 'History', 'The 2025 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for DocuSign, Inc. (Ticker: DOCU). The company is an American software company. Founded in 2003, and based in San Francisco, California it offers an electronic signature solution and services on various devices.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/docu-sign-docu-annual-report-2025', 'https://archive.org/details/docu-sign-docu-annual-report-2025', 'internet-archive:docu-sign-docu-annual-report-2025'),
