  ('455197351339873524', 'Erased Empire Tartaria True History English', 'Remnant, Tamil Intercessor', 2026, 'History', 'The Erased Empire: Reclaiming the True History of Tartaria & the Old World Order A scriptural examination of historical anomalies, maps, architecture, and resets that suggest a forgotten advanced civilization — presented with balance and anchored in Bible truth. All glory to the Lord Jesus Christ. These writings are offered freely as encouragement to the remnant. இந்த எழுத்துக்கள் இயேசு கிறிஸ்துவுக்கு ஆராதனையாகவும், எஞ்சியோருக்கு ஊக்கமாகவும் இலவசமாக வழங்கப்படுகின்றன.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/erased-empire-tartaria-true-history-english', 'https://archive.org/details/erased-empire-tartaria-true-history-english', 'internet-archive:erased-empire-tartaria-true-history-english'),
