  ('999059675089703027', 'Fairbury Has Had 44 Postmasters With 1 Image 03 23 2026', 'Dale C. Maley', 2026, 'History', 'I researched and wrote this article about Fairbury IL postmaster history. Dale C. Maley Fairbury IL Historian March 23, 2026', 'https://archive.org/services/img/fairbury-has-had-44-postmasters-with-1-image-03-23-2026', 'https://archive.org/details/fairbury-has-had-44-postmasters-with-1-image-03-23-2026', 'internet-archive:fairbury-has-had-44-postmasters-with-1-image-03-23-2026'),
  ('589870476792007125', 'Fairbury History Stories Volume 5 Printed Vers Updated 01 27 2026', 'Dale C. Maley', 2026, 'History', 'This is the 5th collection of about 74 stories per book that I wrote. After my Fairbury history stories are published in local media, I put them into books to make multiple volumes. I chose about 74 stories per book because it gives a 6x9 book thickness of about 1 inch, which seems about right :) Many AI programs can not or will not decode PDF files yet, but most of them can decode TXT files, so I uploaded the TXT version also. Each story has at least 1 image with it, which you will see in the PDF version, but not in the TXT version of the file. My hope is that 50+ years from now, long after I am gone, researchers can still find my Fairbury area history information. Dale C. Maley Fairbury IL Historian Jan 2026', 'https://archive.org/services/img/fairbury-history-stories-volume-5-printed-vers-updated-01-27-2026', 'https://archive.org/details/fairbury-history-stories-volume-5-printed-vers-updated-01-27-2026', 'internet-archive:fairbury-history-stories-volume-5-printed-vers-updated-01-27-2026'),
