  ('586616263014766822', 'Five Nights at Freddy''s: Labyrinth - An Interactive Novel', 'The guy on the chair, RockstarSpirit, Scott Cawthon', 2025, 'Science Fiction', 'Please note: This is an unfinished WIP preview, does only get up to a certain point, this version does not get endings specifically. Description: "Explore the mysterious halls of Freddy Fazbear''s Pizza Place, as you, the reader, embark on this perilous journey as Teddy, a down and out now security guard of the Pizzeria location, managing the building and night watching, however, when the building''s animatronic inhabitants start showing weird, almost unsettling actions, Teddy fears he might not escape and make it out alive of this place, forcing him to find any ways possible that he can to survive six whole nights in this prequel to the hit game, Freddy Fazbear''s Pizzeria Simulator in the form of an all new, one of a kind book for all Freddy fans, filled with 25 different endings and compelling storyline!" This book is a fanmade concept book based on the Five Nights at Freddy''s universe and Freddy Fazbear''s Pizzeria Simulator by Scott Cawthon. All credits go to Scott. Secondary credits go to u/RockstarSpirit on Reddit, thanks man for making this book possible.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/five-nights-at-freddys-labyrinth-an-interactive-novel-concept', 'https://archive.org/details/five-nights-at-freddys-labyrinth-an-interactive-novel-concept', 'internet-archive:five-nights-at-freddys-labyrinth-an-interactive-novel-concept'),
