  ('506093494881692758', 'For My Future Wife: A Collection of Romantic Poetry', 'M.Z. Ahmed', 2026, 'Romance', 'For My Future Wife is a deeply personal and soul-stirring collection of 13 poems and reflections by M.Z. Ahmed . Written with the sincerity of a long-form love letter, this booklet is a poetic preparation for a destiny not yet met. It explores the quiet longing of the heart, the magical spark of first encounters, and the sacred honor of lifelong devotion. From the rhythmic charm of "Love At First Sight" to the profound commitment found in "Tangled in Chains," these verses capture the essence of traditional romantic idealism. Whether you are a romantic at heart or seeking words to express your own devotion, this collection serves as a timeless tribute to the "Beloved." Inside this Booklet: 13 Original Poems and 4 Notes from the Poet. Classic, Victorian-style illustrations that bring the romantic themes to life. A sincere exploration of love, longing, and the "madness" of the heart.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/for-my-future-wife', 'https://archive.org/details/for-my-future-wife', 'internet-archive:for-my-future-wife'),
