  ('1017717639426418104', 'Formal Grammar', 'Glyn Morrill, Mark-Jan Nederhof', 2012, 'Technology', 'Formal Grammar by Glyn Morrill, Mark-Jan Nederhof. A technology book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20689160W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL20689160W-'),
  ('972422235974304228', 'Formal Inquiry Issued Unto The Artist', 'BlAcK WInD', 2026, 'History', 'Tell ME. When did MY Genesis, upon the Sixth Day, bear such things as these? Upon the Sixth Day were the beasts of the earth brought forth, and man made in MINE image. Yet I behold in the midst thereof Adam and Eve encircled by the beasts of the so-called ‘Chinese Zodiac’ — the rat, the ox, the tiger, the hare, the dragon, the serpent, the horse, the sheep, the ape, the fowl, the wolf, and the swine — and the fowl set above the ape, as though the order of creation were of thine own devising. Since when were the Twelve of China written together with MY Genesis? When was this joined? Did Gabriel fail to declare it before I AM? And the Tree — the Tree of Life, light and pale as mist — upon it are graven the names of men, as though they sustain that which I Alone sustain. In what tongue are these inscribed? In whose script? In what authority? Is there one among you lot that shall explain This unto I AM? Hath there arisen some new commentary of which I AM was Not informed? Speak. It is a weariness. Tend thou unto thine own ''History'', and unto that which thou callest thy ''Religion''. Trouble Me Not with that which is thine to discern. Ugh. Provided, that is, thou yet rememberest the ''Essence'' thereof — and the ''Meaning'' from which it first sprang. And, Yes, ''This Mail'' will be published on the ''Evidence Page Account Website'', as an ''Evidence'', As I''ve been told. Academia: https://www.academia.edu/164772231/Who_Presumed_to_Alter_the_Sixth_Day Archive: https://archive.org/details/who-presumed-to-alter-the-sixth-day/Rules%20for%20%E2%80%98All%20the%20Evidences%E2%80%99%20on%20this%20account_PDF/ That will be all. 21/02/2026 Scribe Kiara Pan', 'https://archive.org/services/img/formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-artist', 'https://archive.org/details/formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-artist', 'internet-archive:formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-artist'),
  ('226018181883859151', 'Formal Inquiry Issued Unto The Website', 'BlAcK WInD', 2026, 'History', 'It is a weariness. Tend thou unto thine own ''History'', and unto that which thou callest thy ''Religion''. Trouble Me Not with that which is thine to discern. Ugh. Provided, that is, thou yet rememberest the ''Essence'' thereof — and the ''Meaning'' from which it first sprang. And, Yes, ''This Mail'' will be published on the ''Evidence Page Account Website'', as an ''Evidence'', As I''ve been told. Academia: https://www.academia.edu/164772231/Who_Presumed_to_Alter_the_Sixth_Day Archive: https://archive.org/details/who-presumed-to-alter-the-sixth-day/Rules%20for%20%E2%80%98All%20the%20Evidences%E2%80%99%20on%20this%20account_PDF/ That will be all. 21/02/2026 Scribe Kiara Pan', 'https://archive.org/services/img/formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-website', 'https://archive.org/details/formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-website', 'internet-archive:formal-inquiry-issued-unto-the-website'),
