  ('777354381383452302', 'Global Evidence For Ancient Advanced Civilizations The Worldwide Archaeological Synthesis', 'musicims', 2025, 'History', 'This archive contains a comprehensive synthesis of archaeological, genetic, linguistic, and consciousness-related evidence that presents patterns across ancient civilizations challenging conventional chronologies and interpretations.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/global-evidence-for-ancient-advanced-civilizations-the-worldwide-archaeological-synthesis', 'https://archive.org/details/global-evidence-for-ancient-advanced-civilizations-the-worldwide-archaeological-synthesis', 'internet-archive:global-evidence-for-ancient-advanced-civilizations-the-worldwide-archaeological-synthesis'),
  ('161773544777294052', 'Global Food Crises (2025)', 'United Nations FAO', 2025, 'History', '🇺🇳 U.N. Global Report on Food Crises (2025) "This Global Report on Food Crises is another unflinching indictment of a world dangerously off course . Hunger is not an emergency confined to certain pockets of the world or periods of time. It is fast becoming a scar etched into the lives of millions around the globe. Fueled by conflict, geopolitical tensions, climate chaos, environmental vulnerabilities and economic upheaval, food and nutrition crises define the lives of millions – not for weeks or months, but for years and even lifetimes." ~ António Guterres UN Secretary-General May 16th, 2025', 'https://archive.org/services/img/01-global-food-crises-2025', 'https://archive.org/details/01-global-food-crises-2025', 'internet-archive:01-global-food-crises-2025'),
