  ('1017567105101419596', 'God’s Laws Merge With Cosmology', 'Alexandra Marie Dean © 2026 PhantomOverreach', 2026, 'Science', 'Dean has always been a writer at heart, long before spending time authoring lawsuits and navigating the legal system. Passionate about exploring ideas that challenge conventional thinking, she combines her intellect with deep faith, crafting works that confront both secular assumptions and spiritual truths. In this piece, she responds to atheists and those who base their beliefs solely on science, offering a critique of cosmology and the Big Bang theory while highlighting the role of a Creator in the universe. Through her writing, she seeks to illuminate the connection between divine design, moral order, and human understanding, inviting readers to consider a perspective where faith and reason coexist. After years of exhausting battles in court, Dean finally took a night off from drafting tedious lawsuits… and decided to write something actually interesting for once. Enjoy this short read and follow her other works at … msha.ke/phantomoverreach', 'https://archive.org/services/img/godslawsmergewithcosmology', 'https://archive.org/details/godslawsmergewithcosmology', 'internet-archive:godslawsmergewithcosmology'),
  ('32667426485800496', 'God''s Politics', 'Jim Wallis, Kate Middleton', 2005, 'Politics', 'God''s Politics by Jim Wallis, Kate Middleton. A politics book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL21003113W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL21003113W-'),
