  ('1110594876319954666', 'Grid And Weapons V 2.1', 'RuffLuv', 2026, 'Science', 'Complete technical dossier documenting suspected rogue radiofrequency (RF) and electromagnetic field (EMF) transmitters installed on residential rooftops. Includes repeatable GQ EMF-390 and TinySA Ultra measurements, vertical window scans, pocket tests, directional shielding/foil tests, smart meter J3 faults, Octopus Energy confirmation of magnetic field anomalies, and multi-layer frequency mapping (400 MHz, 420–424 MHz pulsed layer, 868 MHz). Covers sniper vs grenade distinctions, body-as-antenna effects, and individualized tuning evidence across Taunton and London. Designed as a practical citizen-science reference for Targeted Individuals and the Warren to generate comparable, timestamped data. Part of the “Follow the Rabbit – Hunt the Clowns” series. All raw logs, screenshots and test protocols included for independent verification.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/grid-and-weapons-v-2.1', 'https://archive.org/details/grid-and-weapons-v-2.1', 'internet-archive:grid-and-weapons-v-2.1'),
