  ('1069591049268732230', 'HAZRAT KHALID BIN WALEED BOOK', 'Ataurrahman Noori', 2016, 'Biography', 'It is a Biography of Great Islamic Soldier Hazrat Khalid Bin Waleed Radiyallahuanhu', 'https://archive.org/services/img/HAZRATKHALIDBINWALEEDBOOK', 'https://archive.org/details/HAZRATKHALIDBINWALEEDBOOK', 'internet-archive:HAZRATKHALIDBINWALEEDBOOK'),
  ('551372749372273342', 'Hazrat Suleman ( AS) Powers, Science, And Nation Building', 'rida azam', 2026, 'Science', 'This article explores the extraordinary authority and knowledge given to Suleiman as mentioned in the Quran and examines how these divine gifts relate to modern scientific concepts. It highlights his control over wind, communication with birds and animals, advanced construction through the jinn, and the instant transfer of the throne of Sheba, connecting these events with present-day fields such as physics, communication technology, energy systems, and theoretical concepts like dimensions and advanced transportation. The article also discusses how these signs demonstrate Allah’s supreme power and serve as inspiration for humanity to pursue knowledge, scientific development, and nation building. It emphasizes that while some abilities were unique miracles granted only to a prophet, the principles of knowledge, innovation, organization, and scientific exploration remain open for humanity to learn and use for the progress of civilization.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/hazrat-suleman-as-powers-science-and-nation-building_202602', 'https://archive.org/details/hazrat-suleman-as-powers-science-and-nation-building_202602', 'internet-archive:hazrat-suleman-as-powers-science-and-nation-building_202602'),
