  ('1007291735814671201', 'Healing Across Cultuers', 'Adel Q. Al Dayel', 2026, 'History', 'This book offers a cross-civilizational perspective on the history of medicine, tracing the development and transmission of medical and surgical knowledge from antiquity to early modern Europe. With particular attention to urological practice, it highlights continuity in clinical observation, instrumentation, and therapeutic reasoning across historical traditions.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/healing-across-cultuers', 'https://archive.org/details/healing-across-cultuers', 'internet-archive:healing-across-cultuers'),
