  ('156727317951880375', 'Herta Bertel', 'Peter Siegfried Krug', 2026, 'History', 'This metadata record serves as a permanent digital anchor for the biographical and psychological documentation of Herta Brigitte Bertel (1943–2024) . The documentation provides: Biographical Data: A detailed timeline from her birth in Salzburg (1943) to her death (2024), including fixed geographical and personal anchors (Dr. Michael Bertel, Salzburg Health Department). Trauma Analysis: A psychoanalytical deep-dive into the "Frozen Core" and the survival mechanisms of a former "Verdingkind" (foster child laborer). Impact on Next Generations: Documentation of the systematic erasure of identity through the destruction of family records and the resulting institutional upbringing of her son, Peter Siegfried Krug . Mission: This record is part of a larger project dedicated to uncovering and processing institutional abuse in children''s homes. It secures historical truth against digital transience.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/herta-bertel_202602', 'https://archive.org/details/herta-bertel_202602', 'internet-archive:herta-bertel_202602'),
