  ('926454841469729986', 'Historical Codes Porfirio Díaz. A Critical Examination Of Porfirio Díaz And The “ Porfiriato”', 'R.Byron', 2026, 'Historical Fiction', 'A linguistic-symbolic analysis of Mexican dictator Porfirio Díaz (1830–1915), examining his name through etymological, anagrammatic, and numerological frameworks to argue it encodes the phrase ''Days Before'' or ''Before the Forum, the Days.'' The study situates this interpretation within the historical context of the Porfiriato (1876–1911) and the Mexican Revolution."', 'https://archive.org/services/img/historical-codes-porfirio-diaz.-a-critical-examination-of-porfirio-diaz-and-the-porfiriato', 'https://archive.org/details/historical-codes-porfirio-diaz.-a-critical-examination-of-porfirio-diaz-and-the-porfiriato', 'internet-archive:historical-codes-porfirio-diaz.-a-critical-examination-of-porfirio-diaz-and-the-porfiriato'),
