  ('593968598239595864', 'Human–AI Collaborative Intelligence and Autonomous Scientific Discovery Systems: Architecture, Evidence, and Governance for the Emerging Knowledge Economy', 'Nabal Kishore Pande', 2026, 'Science', 'This preprint examines the emerging field of human–AI collaborative intelligence and autonomous scientific discovery systems. The paper synthesizes research across artificial intelligence, human–computer interaction, and automated experimentation to analyze how hybrid human–AI systems are transforming knowledge production and scientific research infrastructures. The study reviews historical foundations of human–machine collaboration, empirical research on human–AI teams, and technological developments in autonomous laboratories. It also examines governance challenges associated with AI-driven research systems and discusses implications for the future organization of scientific institutions and knowledge economies. Author: Nabal Kishore Pande Independent Researcher, Pithoragarh, India ORCID: 0009-0007-3325-9966 Keywords: human–AI collaboration, hybrid intelligence, autonomous laboratories, self-driving labs, AI governance, scientific discovery systems, knowledge economy.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/pande-human-ai-collaborative-intelligence-2026-preprint', 'https://archive.org/details/pande-human-ai-collaborative-intelligence-2026-preprint', 'internet-archive:pande-human-ai-collaborative-intelligence-2026-preprint'),
