  ('447397703224348034', 'inventing-the-future-ebook', 'John Buck', 2026, 'History', 'For the first time, a behind-the-scenes look at Apple told through 80+ original stories from key engineers, designers, and product managers who worked there. Read all of the development details for QuickTime®, PowerBook®, LaserWriter®, A/UX®, QuickDraw®, Jonathan, and many secret projects like Rosebud, Laguna, Spider and PenLite. Never before heard stories from the brilliant unknowns like Krakower, Kullmann, Hoffert, and Perlman. These are the people who shaped the digital world we live in today.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/inventing-the-future-ebook', 'https://archive.org/details/inventing-the-future-ebook', 'internet-archive:inventing-the-future-ebook'),
