  ('81372805772642899', 'Katherina Giselle By Sanda Lum', 'Sanda Lum', 2026, 'Literature', 'Katherina Giselle by Sanda Lum Illustrated by Boom Maxwell First published by Austin Macauley Publishers Ltd in October 2023 This version was compiled by Sanda Lum in January 2026 Sanda Lum (Arakanese Australian author of English children’s picture books titled ‘Katherina Giselle’ and ‘Serin’). Brave Katherina Giselle is a gifted teacher. She obtains a teaching job at a prestigious school in London during COVID-19 era. Principal Leo at the prestigious school does not allow her to teach anything creative. Although she is teaching at an elite school, she feels that she does not have any freedom. But her compassionate American friend Bear encourages her to use her creative thoughts to write. She secretly writes fantasy stories about creativity and equality. She becomes a top-selling author before long. She somehow manages to keep her secret hidden from Principal Leo’s notice. Things take a shaky turn when tyrannical Principal Leo becomes aware of her creative publications. Principal Leo thinks Katherina is a terrified typical gazelle and that he could silence her and diminish her creative ideas by threatening her. Katherina Giselle’s mysterious and innovative thoughts give her powers beyond Principal Leo’s imagination. Profoundly inventive and entertainingly educative, Katherina Giselle encapsulates the importance of courage, righteousness, creativity, and imagination. This is a timeless story for all those who love to imagine.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/katherina-giselle-by-sanda-lum', 'https://archive.org/details/katherina-giselle-by-sanda-lum', 'internet-archive:katherina-giselle-by-sanda-lum'),
  ('442934255299383640', 'Kathlamet texts', 'Franz Boas', 1901, 'Mythology', 'Kathlamet texts by Franz Boas. A mythology book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL808224W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL808224W-'),
  ('813558731919511102', 'Kathlamet texts', 'Franz Boas', 1901, 'Mythology', 'Kathlamet texts by Franz Boas', 'https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/1851815-L.jpg', 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL808224W', 'internet-archive:ol-works-OL808224W'),
  ('310343010296772006', 'Kautilya Arthshastra Hindi', 'Chanakya', 2025, 'Historical Fiction', 'Now in Hindi Kautilya, also known as Chanakya, is India’s most illustrious political economist of all time. He regarded economic activity as the driving force behind the functioning of any political dispensation. In fact, he went to the extent of saying that revenue should take priority over the army because sustaining the army was possible out of a well-managed revenue system. Kautilya advocated limiting the taxation power of the state, having low rates of taxation, maintaining a gradual increase in taxation and most importantly devising a tax structure that ensured compliance. He strongly encouraged foreign Trade, basing it on the premise that for a successful trade contract to be established, it had to be beneficial to all. He emphasized state control and investment in land, water and mining. Kautilya was a true statesman who bridged the gap between experience and vision. For Kautilya, good governance was paramount. He suggested built-in checks and balances in systems and procedures for the containment of malpractices. Many postulates of Kautilya’s philosophy of political economy are applicable to contemporary times.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/kautilya-arthshastra-hindi', 'https://archive.org/details/kautilya-arthshastra-hindi', 'internet-archive:kautilya-arthshastra-hindi'),
  ('353080963677202248', 'Kawaii Cafe Bento: Classic and Fun Bentos to Make at Home', 'Yuko', 2026, 'Non-Fiction', 'Create your own quick, easy, and irresistibly cute bento box meals! Kawaii Cafe Bento gives you over 50 healthy, delicious options, beautifully illustrated in a fun anime style. This inventive book brings the art of Japanese bento boxes to life with a playful twist, perfect for anyone looking to save money and enjoy a balanced, satisfying meal each day–with an extra touch of kawaii charm. Offering recipes for both mains and sides, this book invites you to mix and match daily, using a combination of traditional and nontraditional ingredients. Adorable kawaii illustrations bring each recipe to life, making bento-making fun and accessible for seasoned cooks and newcomers alike. Learn Different types of bento boxes and accessoriesHow to assemble your boxWhat pantry staples to keep on handTips for planning ahead to make your morning prep a breezeWith cute and easy-to-follow recipes, there’s a bento style for Classic Japanese BentoNoodle BentoSandwich BentoKid BentoAnd more!From the series that includes Kawaii Cafe Ramen and Kawaii Cafe Bubble Tea, Kawaii Cafe Bento features adorable illustrations designed to create a charming and whimsical cooking experience. Dive into a world of fun, flavor, and creativity that makes bento boxes a joy to prepare, eat, and share with loved ones.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/oceanof-pdf.com-kawaii-cafe-bento-amy-kimoto-kahn', 'https://archive.org/details/oceanof-pdf.com-kawaii-cafe-bento-amy-kimoto-kahn', 'internet-archive:oceanof-pdf.com-kawaii-cafe-bento-amy-kimoto-kahn'),
  ('910265203930728779', 'KDP PRINT INTERIOR SPREAD', 'JESSE DAVID TRIPP', 2026, 'Science Fiction', 'ALIEN INVASION BOOK, EVIL WATER ALIENS THREATEN TO TAKE OVER THE CITY OF DALLAS AND ONE WOMAN ARMED WITH A SLEW OF SUMMER CAMP TEENS HAS DECIDED TO STOP THEM', 'https://archive.org/services/img/kdp-print-interior-spread_202602', 'https://archive.org/details/kdp-print-interior-spread_202602', 'internet-archive:kdp-print-interior-spread_202602'),
  ('965396609283556514', 'Keep Gaia DNA V2 20260320', 'Kobayashi Kazunari', 2026, 'Science', 'KeepGaiaDNA is a science story exploring the future of life originating from Earth. This work is built around scientific themes such as planetary science, space exploration, biotechnology, and terraforming. The central question of this story is: How might life from Earth continue beyond the lifetime of the Sun? This project is shared freely for science high school students around the world.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/keep-gaia-dna-v-1-20260303_202603', 'https://archive.org/details/keep-gaia-dna-v-1-20260303_202603', 'internet-archive:keep-gaia-dna-v-1-20260303_202603'),
