  ('768282792698549282', 'Keeping Curiosity Honest Understanding Bias, Perception, And Scientific Integrity', 'Tanja Glittenberg', 2026, 'Science', 'This presentation explores the balance between curiosity and critical thinking in scientific observation. It addresses how bias, fatigue, expectation, and narrative influence perception - and why staying aware of these factors is essential for maintaining integrity in data-driven research, particularly within the Project Hessdalen. Narrated video version of this presentation can be found here: https://archive.org/details/keeping-curiosity-honest-understanding-bias-perception-and-scientific-integrity-ia', 'https://archive.org/services/img/keeping-curiosity-honest-understanding-bias-perception-and-scientific-integrity_202603', 'https://archive.org/details/keeping-curiosity-honest-understanding-bias-perception-and-scientific-integrity_202603', 'internet-archive:keeping-curiosity-honest-understanding-bias-perception-and-scientific-integrity_202603'),
