  ('965637414293352688', 'Literature and Documentary Film as Criteria of Reality: Observatio', 'Darya Spiridonov', 2026, 'Literature', 'Interdisciplinary analysis examining documentary film and literary realism as epistemological practices grounded in observation, memory, and social inscription. The article explores how documentary and literary forms function as criteria of reality by constructing archives of experience that resist abstraction, ideological distortion, and historical erasure.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/literature-and-documentary-film-as-criteria-of-reality-observation-memory-and-the-social-archive', 'https://archive.org/details/literature-and-documentary-film-as-criteria-of-reality-observation-memory-and-the-social-archive', 'internet-archive:literature-and-documentary-film-as-criteria-of-reality-observation-memory-and-the-social-archive'),
