  ('789789417844561377', 'Live Nation 2024 Annual Report', 'Live Nation Entertainment', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for Live Nation Entertainment (Ticker: LYV). The company is an American global entertainment corporation that promotes, operates and manages ticket sales for live entertainment in the United States as well as internationally. In addition, the company operates entertainment venues and manages the careers of recording artists. The company was founded in 2010 following the merger of Live Nation and Ticketmaster and is headquartered in Beverly Hills, California.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/live-nation-entertainment-lyv-annual-report-2024', 'https://archive.org/details/live-nation-entertainment-lyv-annual-report-2024', 'internet-archive:live-nation-entertainment-lyv-annual-report-2024'),
