  ('845929811515249229', 'Malabar Manual', 'William Logan', 2026, 'History', 'A comprehensive gazetteer and administrative manual of the Malabar District under British rule. Originally published in 1887, this seminal work covers the geography, people, religion, history, and land revenue systems of Malabar. It remains a primary source for understanding the region''s colonial history and social structure', 'https://archive.org/services/img/malabar-manual', 'https://archive.org/details/malabar-manual', 'internet-archive:malabar-manual'),
