  ('696907919318333145', 'Mammiyur Sri Mahadeva Temple, Guruvayoor, Kerala Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'This PDF provides detailed information about Mammiyur Sri Mahadeva Temple, an ancient and revered Shiva temple located near the famous Guruvayoor Sri Krishna Temple in Thrissur district, Kerala, India. According to temple tradition, the pilgrimage to Guruvayoor Temple is considered complete only after visiting Mammiyur Mahadeva Temple, where Lord Shiva is worshipped as the guardian deity of Guruvayoor. The document includes information on the temple’s location, history, legends, spiritual significance, architecture, main deity and sub-deities, daily poojas, special rituals, festivals, facilities for devotees, nearby temples, tourist attractions, and accommodation options. This compilation is intended for devotees, pilgrims, researchers, and readers interested in Indian temples, Hindu spirituality, and cultural heritage. Prepared and shared freely for the benefit of devotees and spiritual readers.Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar, a Mechanical Engineer and former professor, has authored several free ebooks on Indian temples, saints, and spiritual heritage for the benefit of devotees and readers.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/mammiyur-sri-mahadeva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/mammiyur-sri-mahadeva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed', 'internet-archive:mammiyur-sri-mahadeva-temple-guruvayoor-kerala-compressed'),
