  ('169195468617452916', 'Mastercard 2024 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'Mastercard Incorporated', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for Mastercard Incorporated (Ticker: MA). The company is an American financial services company that processes payments between the banks of merchants and the card-issuing financial institutions of their customers who use Mastercard branded credit and debit cards. Originally founded in 1966, the company has been publicly traded since 2006 and is headquartered in Purchase, New York.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/01-mastercard-ma-proxy-statement-2025-06-24-c', 'https://archive.org/details/01-mastercard-ma-proxy-statement-2025-06-24-c', 'internet-archive:01-mastercard-ma-proxy-statement-2025-06-24-c'),
