  ('1041293454483807147', 'Mehandipur Balaji Temple, Rajasthan Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'This illustrated PDF provides a concise introduction to the famous Mehandipur Balaji Temple located in Dausa district of Rajasthan, India. The temple is dedicated to Lord Hanuman (Balaji) and is widely known for its unique spiritual healing traditions. The document covers the location, history, legends, temple architecture, main and sub-deities, daily rituals, special poojas, festivals, facilities for devotees, nearby temples, and other useful information for visitors and readers interested in Indian temple heritage.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/mehandipur-balaji-temple-rajasthan-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/mehandipur-balaji-temple-rajasthan-compressed', 'internet-archive:mehandipur-balaji-temple-rajasthan-compressed'),
