  ('149061761300770939', 'MGM Resorts International 2025 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'MGM Resorts International', 2026, 'History', 'The 2025 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for MGM Resorts International. (Ticker: MGM). MGM Resorts is an American company that owns and operates resort properties and casinos primarily in Las Vegas and Macau. The company was formerly known as MGM Mirage before changing their name in 2010. MGM Resorts was founded in 1986 and is based in Las Vegas, Nevada.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/mgm-resorts-international-mgm-proxy-statement-2026-05-06', 'https://archive.org/details/mgm-resorts-international-mgm-proxy-statement-2026-05-06', 'internet-archive:mgm-resorts-international-mgm-proxy-statement-2026-05-06'),
