  ('688280192510934324', 'MOD Response Regarding Decommissioning Of Couvre Porte Reservoir', 'Ministry of Defence Secretariat', 2026, 'History', 'An official response to a Freedom of Information request (FOI2026/04047) regarding the decommissioning date and historical records of the Couvre Porte (Brompton) reservoir in Gillingham, Kent. The document confirms that while no specific decommissioning date is held in recorded information, the structure was likely taken out of service between 1955 and 1964 during the conversion to municipal mains.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/mod-response-regarding-decommissioning-of-couvre-porte-reservoir', 'https://archive.org/details/mod-response-regarding-decommissioning-of-couvre-porte-reservoir', 'internet-archive:mod-response-regarding-decommissioning-of-couvre-porte-reservoir'),
