  ('701172418057232022', 'Mr Appleton And The Gardens Of Spring', 'Rijamekee Tjikuzu Veii', 2026, 'Romance', 'Mr Appleton and the Garden of Spring is a historical literary novel set in the early 20th century, following Claire, a young governess working at a rigid boarding school, and her encounters with a quiet gardener whose work begins to transform both the grounds and the lives around him. Set against themes of renewal, integrity, secrecy, and quiet resistance, the story explores institutional corruption, personal conscience, and the promise of new beginnings through the symbolism of gardening and seasonal change. This text is shared for free public access via the Internet Archive. If you want it shorter , this also works well: A historical literary novel set in the early 20th century, following a governess whose life is quietly transformed by a new gardener, a hidden investigation, and the slow promise of renewal.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/mr-appleton-and-the-gardens-of-spring', 'https://archive.org/details/mr-appleton-and-the-gardens-of-spring', 'internet-archive:mr-appleton-and-the-gardens-of-spring'),
