  ('992645493002014057', 'Mud, muscle, and miracles : marine salvage in the United States Navy', 'Bartholomew, C. A., 1940-1990, Milwee, William I., 1937-', 2009, 'History', 'Mud, Muscle, and Miracles, Marine Salvage in the United States Navy by Charles A. Bartholomew, William I. Milwee 2009 ISBN 978-0-945274-60-5 "This edition extends Bart''s original into twenty-first century salvage, including updated procedures and technology. It covers eighteen representative salvage operations spanning the breadth and the depth (literally) of recent experience such as record-setting deep-ocean recovery operations, submersible rescue, undersea oil reclamation, and expeditionary combat salvage." Digitized by http://www.history.navy.mil', 'https://archive.org/services/img/MudMuscleAndMiracles', 'https://archive.org/details/MudMuscleAndMiracles', 'internet-archive:MudMuscleAndMiracles'),
