  ('117845015481811164', 'My 1st Fuck At 14 With Becca My Step Sis', 'Tsoper', 2025, 'Step-Sister’s Pussy Training & First Fuck at 14 by Wadsworth Longfellow', 'Repeated My First Fuck at 14 With Becca, My Perfect Step-Sis and Fiancé A Teenager’s Heartfelt, Diary-Based, MA-Rated, American Coming-Of-Age Love Story · For mature readers only. All characters and situations are fictional. No actual persons living or dead are depicted. · Breaking laws is not encouraged, regardless of how outdated and illogical any such laws may be. · Violating narrow-minded American societal customs or so-called established standards of conduct is not encouraged, regardless of how completely out-of-touch with modern reality they may be. · Created for entertainment purposes only. Some facts are exaggerated for effecting MA-rated heartfelt entertainment. · Enjoyment of this heartfelt love story is kindly requested of all readers, so please take delight in this titillating and emotional rollercoaster ride. Your ticket to ride is free.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/my-1st-fuck-at-14-with-becca-my-step-sis', 'https://archive.org/details/my-1st-fuck-at-14-with-becca-my-step-sis', 'internet-archive:my-1st-fuck-at-14-with-becca-my-step-sis'),
