  ('260775441928227049', 'Nelson Chemistry 11 Textbook', 'Nelson Education', 2011, 'Science', 'This is the full textbook PDF for Grade 11 Chemistry. More info on it can be found on the publisher''s webpage . This textbook is legally available to students taking this course at a school that has paid for the textbook. The full size textbook is 155M, but I''ve also made a compressed one that''s 80M. No text is changed, the images are just lower quality.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/chem11', 'https://archive.org/details/chem11', 'internet-archive:chem11'),
