  ('562289790998672470', 'Neural Narrative ( Literary Theory)', 'Edebiyatt', 2026, 'neural narrative', '"Neural Narrative" (Turkish: Nöral Anlatı ) is an innovative narrative technique developed by author Oğulcan Ahmed Polat. It liberates fiction from being confined solely to human perception, structuring it instead as a hybrid flow designed to be simultaneously tracked and processed by both biological (human) and digital (Artificial Intelligence) readers.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/neural-narrative-literary-theory', 'https://archive.org/details/neural-narrative-literary-theory', 'internet-archive:neural-narrative-literary-theory'),
