  ('61574498773286655', 'NIGHTCAP - Vol 01: A Queer Nightlife Archive Zine from Post and Pulse Collect', 'C. James Polkinghorne', 2026, 'History', 'NIGHTCAP is a free digital zine from Post and Pulse Collect , the queer nightlife archive initiative of the James Polkinghorne Cultural Foundation for Art, Health, and Communal Wellness (JPCF) . Drawing from the Post and Pulse Collect Archive , the publication showcases queer nightlife posters, club flyers, and LGBTQ+ ephemera through curated themes that document the visual culture, artists, venues, and communities that shaped queer nightlife history.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/nightcap-vol-1-e', 'https://archive.org/details/nightcap-vol-1-e', 'internet-archive:nightcap-vol-1-e'),
