  ('456285080144848033', 'Ogden''s Basic English Words List Alphabetic', 'Charles K. Ogden. Basic-English Institute : Dedicated to the expansion of Ogden''s Basic English.', 2008, 'History', '"Basic-English Institute : Dedicated to the expansion of Ogden''s Basic English. Basic English is a selection of 850 English words, used in simple structural patterns, which is both an international auxiliary language and a self-contained first stage for the teaching of any form of wider or Standard English. A subset, a complete language, yet with no unlearning to progress." http://www.basic-english.org/institute.html', 'https://archive.org/services/img/ogdens-basic-english-words-list-alphabetic', 'https://archive.org/details/ogdens-basic-english-words-list-alphabetic', 'internet-archive:ogdens-basic-english-words-list-alphabetic'),
