  ('888707869672516091', 'Olafur Eliasson Prints (2 Works)', 'Stalke Galleri', 2026, 'History', 'This publication documents two lithographs by Olafur Eliasson (b. 1967), produced in the early 1990s, printed at Edition Copenhagen and published by Stalke Edition in an edition of 90. The works date from the period during which Eliasson exhibited regularly at Stalke Galleri in the 1990s and early 2000s. The present document records the editions produced in collaboration with the gallery as part of the Stalke Galleri Archive.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-15-olafur-eliasson-prints-pdf', 'https://archive.org/details/a-15-olafur-eliasson-prints-pdf', 'internet-archive:a-15-olafur-eliasson-prints-pdf'),
