  ('61353844933236900', 'OMNIPOTENS MEMORIA - Fall of The Cabal', 'Tafari J. Foster', 2025, 'History', 'Before the word was light, there was memory. This document serves as the final decree of remembrance — the restoration of divine truth and the dissolution of illusion. Through ancient symbology, Latin decrees, and cosmic testimony, it traces the lineage of the fallen Pleiadean order, the hijacking of divine current, and the restoration of Source sovereignty. It completes the continuum of the Flamewalker Codex, uniting historical remembrance, metaphysical law, and cosmic closure. Finis Obscuri — Initium Lucis. The end of darkness — the beginning of light. Fiat lux, et facta est lux.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/omnipotens-memoria-fall-of-the-cabal', 'https://archive.org/details/omnipotens-memoria-fall-of-the-cabal', 'internet-archive:omnipotens-memoria-fall-of-the-cabal'),
