  ('475242555565081606', 'On Amphibians and Reptiles in Linnaeus''s Students'' Dissertations', 'International Society for the History and Bibliography of Herpetology (ISHBH)', 2026, 'History', 'Lavilla, Esteban O. 2026. On Amphibians and Reptiles in Linnaeus’s Students’ Dissertations. International Society for the History and Bibliography of Herpetology, Salt Lake City, Utah, vi, 136 pages. (ISBN 9798218887766 Hardcover). Volume 4 of the Wahlgreniana series English translation of seven complete dissertations and the herpetological sections of an addition twenty-five dissertations. An extensive bibliography and 466 footnotes have been added for clarity.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/linnaeuss-student-dissertations', 'https://archive.org/details/linnaeuss-student-dissertations', 'internet-archive:linnaeuss-student-dissertations'),
