  ('871867455379824916', 'Orchard Park and Other Works', 'Tom Fahy', 2010, 'Meta-Narrative', 'The author disavows this book in its entirety, and in fact, reproves it. The unsuspecting reader, then, is enjoined to treat it as a mere curiosity, and to hold it in no greater esteem than may be rightfully assigned to any misguided work of Gnosticism.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/OrchardParkANovelByTomFahy', 'https://archive.org/details/OrchardParkANovelByTomFahy', 'internet-archive:OrchardParkANovelByTomFahy'),
