  ('239726055560883357', 'OS2x2 Whitepaper 2.5', 'OS2x2 Research Team', 2026, 'Science', 'Foundations of Strategic Computing in AI Systems (Whitepaper v2.5) This official whitepaper outlines the formal mathematical and logical framework underlying the OS2x2 platform. It introduces the foundational concepts of Strategic Computing, focusing on the architecture of Strategic State-Spaces and Strategic Algebra (Operational Calculus) for AI and dynamic decision-making systems. The document serves as the theoretical and architectural blueprint for the OS2x2 platform, which acts as the reference implementation layer for these multidimensional models. Key Concepts Covered: • Strategic Algebra and Operational Calculus • The Formal Model of Strategic State-Spaces • Multidimensional Decision-Making Frameworks • System Architecture for Strategic Computing Archival Purpose & IP: This document (Version 2.5, published March 2026) is permanently archived to establish prior art, cryptographically timestamp intellectual property (IP), and provide a definitive public reference for the OS2x2 platform methodology. Official Website: https://os2x2.com Author: OS2x2 Research Team', 'https://archive.org/services/img/os2x2-whitepaper-2.5', 'https://archive.org/details/os2x2-whitepaper-2.5', 'internet-archive:os2x2-whitepaper-2.5'),
