  ('573053666681477322', 'Our History Too: A Women''s History Zine', 'Unknown', 2026, 'Historical Fiction', 'A collection of 10 short biographies of incredible women from American history, including Frances Kelsey, Miss Major Griffin-Gracy, Kalpana Chawla, Ofelia Zepeda, and more. My goal with this project was to have fun, express myself, and share the moving stories of these women''s lives and achievements. I also wanted to highlight some of the important contributions women have made to our society that get left out of history books. Enjoy! Background image by Puzzle Creative on Unplash.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/womens-history-zine', 'https://archive.org/details/womens-history-zine', 'internet-archive:womens-history-zine'),
