  ('1050331327393010623', 'Pályatársak-írásai. KÜRTI ISTVÁN, okl. építőmérnök, főmérnök ifjúkori emlékei; mappa', 'Dipl.-Civil-Eng. István Kürti and Dr.-Eng. Tibor Kausay', 2026, 'History', 'In this folder, we have collected the writings of István Kürti, a civil engineer and chief engineer based in Budapest, written between 2019 and 2016, about his youthful memories.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/palyatarsak-irasai-kurti-istvan-ifjukori-emlekek', 'https://archive.org/details/palyatarsak-irasai-kurti-istvan-ifjukori-emlekek', 'internet-archive:palyatarsak-irasai-kurti-istvan-ifjukori-emlekek'),
