  ('167095431223635554', 'Panancheri Mudikkode Shiva Temple, Kerala Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'This free ebook provides useful information about Panancheri Mudikkode Shiva Temple, an ancient temple dedicated to Lord Shiva located in Panancheri village in Thrissur district, Kerala, India. The book includes details on the temple’s location, history, legends, architectural features, main deity and sub-deities, daily rituals and poojas, special ceremonies, festivals, facilities for devotees, nearby temples, nearby tourist attractions and travel information. The aim of this small publication is to document and share knowledge about lesser-known temples of India and to help devotees and travelers. This ebook is compiled for free public distribution. Author: Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 'https://archive.org/services/img/panancheri-mudikkode-shiva-temple-kerala-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/panancheri-mudikkode-shiva-temple-kerala-compressed', 'internet-archive:panancheri-mudikkode-shiva-temple-kerala-compressed'),
