  ('721622276915064059', 'PayPal 2024 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'PayPal Holdings, Inc.', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for PayPal Holdings, Inc. (Ticker: PYPL). The corporation, headquartered in San Jose, California is an American technology platform that enables digital payments on behalf of merchants and consumers worldwide. Founded in 1998 as Confinity, the company went public in 2002 and merged into eBay later that year. In 2015, the company was spun-off to eBay shareholders as an independent company.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/pay-pal-holdings-pypl-annual-report-combined-proxy-2025', 'https://archive.org/details/pay-pal-holdings-pypl-annual-report-combined-proxy-2025', 'internet-archive:pay-pal-holdings-pypl-annual-report-combined-proxy-2025'),
