  ('463806938931045372', 'Pittsburgh Pirates 2025 Media Guide', 'Pittsburgh Pirates', 2025, 'History', 'A media guide produced by the Pittsburgh Pirates in preparation for the 2025 Major League Baseball (MLB) season. This edition, the 144th in the team''s history, gave historical statistics and information on the Pirates club that was led by Manager Derek Shelton.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/pittsburgh-pirates-2025-media-guide-c', 'https://archive.org/details/pittsburgh-pirates-2025-media-guide-c', 'internet-archive:pittsburgh-pirates-2025-media-guide-c'),
