  ('887332522686497543', 'Players In The Rapture Theory', 'Ockert Jansen van Nieuwenhuizen', 2026, 'History', 'An in-depth historical investigation into the origins of the Pre-Tribulation Rapture doctrine. Trace the theological timeline from 16th-century Jesuit Futurism (Francisco Ribera) through the visions of Margaret MacDonald and the systemic Dispensationalism of John Nelson Darby, to its global popularization via D.L. Moody and the Scofield Reference Bible. This study examines the scriptural integrity of the "Secret Rapture" against the nature of the Holy Trinity and the warnings of the Early Church Fathers.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/players-in-the-rapture-theory', 'https://archive.org/details/players-in-the-rapture-theory', 'internet-archive:players-in-the-rapture-theory'),
