  ('576586414049952509', 'Police Investigation of Fatal Shooting — Anacortes Washington — March 10 2026 — Photo by Ashlan Chidester', 'ashlan chidester', 2026, 'History', 'Archival Record — Anacortes Police Investigation Source text captured from a public notice regarding a police investigation in Anacortes, Washington (ZIP 98221). Original notice text: "Anacortes Police officers are investigating a shooting that occurred in the 1400 block of K Avenue at approximately 6:30 a.m. Tuesday morning. A man and a woman are confirmed deceased from gunshot wounds. There is no danger to the public, and APD will release more information after further investigation." This archival snapshot documents the contemporaneous public notice related to the incident. Photograph and documentation by Ashlan Chidester (author and independent researcher) , Anacortes, Washington. Image captured and preserved by Ashlan Chidester on March 10, 2026 for historical record and archival reference. Credit: Ashlan Chidester . Location: 1400 block of K Avenue, Anacortes, Washington, United States ZIP Code: 98221 Time reported: approximately 6:30 AM Date preserved: 2026-03-10', 'https://archive.org/services/img/police-investigation-of-fatal-shooting-anacortes-washington-march-10-2026-', 'https://archive.org/details/police-investigation-of-fatal-shooting-anacortes-washington-march-10-2026-', 'internet-archive:police-investigation-of-fatal-shooting-anacortes-washington-march-10-2026-'),
