values
  ('905436211166816179', 'Research Design Qualitative, Quantitative, And Mixed Methods Approaches By John W. Creswell J. David Creswell', 'John W. Creswell; J. David Creswell', 2025, 'Literature', 'Research Design: Qualitative, Quantitative, and Mixed Methods Approaches (5th ed., 2018) is John W. Creswell and J. David Creswell’s refined blueprint for planning rigorous empirical studies. Anchored in four philosophical worldviews—post-positivism, constructivism, transformative frameworks, and pragmatism—the book walks readers from topic selection and literature review through theory use, writing strategies, ethics, purpose statements, research questions, and the distinct procedures of qualitative, quantitative, and mixed-methods inquiry. Expanded coverage of action research, visual and online qualitative methods, memoing, and advanced mixed-methods designs, plus updated examples and checklists, make this edition an indispensable guide for graduate students, early-career scholars, and practitioners who need to craft defensible proposals and publishable studies.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/research-design-qualitative-quantitative-and-mixed-methods-approaches-by-john-w.', 'https://archive.org/details/research-design-qualitative-quantitative-and-mixed-methods-approaches-by-john-w.', 'internet-archive:research-design-qualitative-quantitative-and-mixed-methods-approaches-by-john-w.'),
