  ('972327696143431351', 'Review in The Globe and Mail of Victor Teboul''s Le Jour. Émergence du Libéralisme Moderne au Québec, by Ronald Sutherland', 'Victor Teboul', 2026, 'Literature', 'Review by Ronald Sutherland in The Globe and Mail of Victor Teboul’s Le Jour. Émergence du libéralisme moderne au Québec Victor Teboul''s candid analysis of the myths and images of the Jew in Quebec, published in 1977, created quite a stir. His latest book, a study of the weekly newspaper called Le Jour, which was founded by Jean- Charles Harvey in 1937, deals with an equally controversial subject and is equally thorough and candid. (…) Teboul''s study demonstrates that almost every reform espoused by Le Jour in the thirties and forties has become a fact of life in the Quebec of the seventies and eighties.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/rewiew-in-the-globe-and-mail-of-le-jour.-emergence-du-liberalisme-moderne-au-quebec', 'https://archive.org/details/rewiew-in-the-globe-and-mail-of-le-jour.-emergence-du-liberalisme-moderne-au-quebec', 'internet-archive:rewiew-in-the-globe-and-mail-of-le-jour.-emergence-du-liberalisme-moderne-au-quebec'),
