  ('732664767793669395', 'Sailor, Clinician, Leader, And Woodworker: The Journey Of Rear Adm. Anthony La Course', 'U.S. Navy. Bureau of Medicine and Surgery', 2026, 'Biography', 'by André B. Sobocinski, Historian, U.S. Navy Bureau of Medicine and Surgery (BUMED) Biography of Rear Adm. Anthony LaCourse covering different stages of his Navy journey: attending field medical training as a hospital corpsman in 1989, promotion to 1-star flag rank aboard USS Constitution on Oct. 1, 2025. Originally posted at https://www.dvidshub.net/news/556190/sailor-clinician-leader-and-woodworker-journey-rear-adm-anthony-lacourse', 'https://archive.org/services/img/sailor-clinician-leader-and-woodworker-the-journey-of-rear-adm.-anthony-la-course', 'https://archive.org/details/sailor-clinician-leader-and-woodworker-the-journey-of-rear-adm.-anthony-la-course', 'internet-archive:sailor-clinician-leader-and-woodworker-the-journey-of-rear-adm.-anthony-la-course'),
