  ('193960879107976997', 'Şeker Dünyası Geçektende Var Olabilir Mi (Ansiklopedi)', 'Sahne Dünya', 2026, 'Science', 'Could Candy World, the biggest dream of your childhood, actually exist? Theoretically yes, but it''s not sustainable, and besides, Candy World is complete nonsense from a biological perspective. You can find out why in the PDF! Have fun!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/seker-dunyasi-gecektende-var-olabilir-mi-ansiklopedi', 'https://archive.org/details/seker-dunyasi-gecektende-var-olabilir-mi-ansiklopedi', 'internet-archive:seker-dunyasi-gecektende-var-olabilir-mi-ansiklopedi'),
