  ('863259617947860406', 'Shivrayancha Chaava', 'Jay Choraghe', 2025, 'History', 'I am Jay Choraghe, an illustrator and storyteller, and this book is a children’s storytelling journey into the life of Chhatrapati Sambhaji Maharaj. Renowned for his courage, intellect, and unwavering spirit, Sambhaji’s story is one of resilience and bravery. Through vivid illustrations and engaging narration, this book brings his adventures, struggles, and triumphs to life, making history both accessible and inspiring for young readers. A tale of valor and legacy, it introduces children to Shivrayancha Chhava the warrior spirit that defined his reign.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/online-post', 'https://archive.org/details/online-post', 'internet-archive:online-post'),
