  ('703492927443887537', 'Shree Gurubhoodiswami', 'DR RENUKA PRASAD K S HUNSUR MYSORE DISTRICT', 2026, 'History', 'A HISTORY OF SHREE GURU BOODI SWAMI AND UKKINKANTHE MATA', 'https://archive.org/services/img/shree-gurubhoodiswami', 'https://archive.org/details/shree-gurubhoodiswami', 'internet-archive:shree-gurubhoodiswami'),
  ('143629650537426118', 'Shree Somnath Jyotirlinga Temple In Saurashtra, Gujarat', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'This is a detailed, self-compiled guide to Shree Somnath Jyotirlinga Temple in Prabhas Patan, Veraval, Gujarat – the first of the 12 Aadi Jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva, known as the "Shrine Eternal." The PDF covers legendary origins (built by Moon God Soma), historical invasions (Mahmud of Ghazni''s destruction in January 1026 CE, later by Alauddin Khalji, Aurangzeb, etc.), repeated rebuilds by Hindu rulers, post-Independence reconstruction initiated by Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel with public donations (consecrated May 11, 1951, by President Rajendra Prasad), and the recent Somnath Swabhiman Parv 2026 (January 8-11, marking 1000 years of resilience since 1026 + 75 years of 1951 restoration, with PM Narendra Modi''s participation including Shaurya Yatra with 108 horses, Omkar chanting, drone shows, and public address emphasizing victory over defeat). It includes Chalukya/Māru-Gurjara architecture (155-ft shikhar with golden kalash), main deity Somnath Jyotirlinga & associated shrines, daily poojas/rituals/timings (6 AM–10 PM, aartis), special sevas (e.g., Savalaksha Bilva Pooja, Rudra Abhishek) with charges, festivals (Mahashivratri, Kartik Purnima), facilities (Atithi Bhavan accommodation, annadana), donation info, nearby attractions (beach, Bhalka Tirth, Gir Forest), and more. An essential resource for pilgrims, researchers, and devotees celebrating Somnath''s unbreakable faith and civilizational pride. Jai Somnath Mahadev!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/shree-somnath-jyotirlinga-temple-in-saurashtra-gujarat', 'https://archive.org/details/shree-somnath-jyotirlinga-temple-in-saurashtra-gujarat', 'internet-archive:shree-somnath-jyotirlinga-temple-in-saurashtra-gujarat'),
