  ('1123775931552612952', 'Sir John Pasmoer (abt 1535 - 1589) Descendants - Thirteen Generations', 'Richard Lee Gleason', 2011, 'Biography', 'A document containing 950 names of descendants of Sir John Pasmoer (abt 1535-1589) encompassing 13 generations. Includes some photos, many notes and narratives, and is thoroughly sourced. Among Sir John’s descendants are U.S. President Gerald Ford (p. 329) and nineteen year-old Army soldier Pfc. Bradley Kritzer who was killed in Fallujah, Iraq in May of 2004. Dated February 2011. 414 pages. Surname Index begins on p. 366; Sources begin on p. 334 Corrections and additions are welcomed! May be copied and freely distributed but only in it''s entirety. Do NOT publish the contents of this document to any web site without permission! Thank you!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/PasmoerSirJohnabt15351589Descendants', 'https://archive.org/details/PasmoerSirJohnabt15351589Descendants', 'internet-archive:PasmoerSirJohnabt15351589Descendants'),
