  ('236695300408633949', 'SIUC VAX', 'Christian St-Louis', 2026, 'Science', 'This document constitutes a public prior disclosure of the SIUC‑VAX platform, developed by Christian St‑Louis within the Unified Coherence Integration System (SIUC). It presents an innovative vaccine approach based on the identification and exploitation of viral coherence invariants—stable, non‑mutable structural elements essential to infection. By focusing on these invariants rather than variable antigens, SIUC‑VAX aims to enable the design of durable, mutation‑resistant immunogens. The intellectual property strategy relies on a defensive patent followed by open‑source release, ensuring global accessibility while preventing any exclusive appropriation. This publication establishes an opposable public timestamp and supports an ethical, scientific, and collaborative approach to vaccine innovation.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/siuc-vax', 'https://archive.org/details/siuc-vax', 'internet-archive:siuc-vax'),
