  ('977923620102144555', 'Stalke Edition – Exhibition Catalogues Overview (1987–2024)', 'Stalke Galleri', 2026, 'History', 'Since 1987, Stalke Galleri has continuously produced exhibition catalogues and publications as an integral part of the gallery’s artistic and curatorial practice. This overview publication presents a selected list of exhibition catalogues published between 1987 and 2024, reflecting both the development of the artists represented by the gallery and the historical evolution of Stalke Galleri itself. The catalogues were produced in connection with solo exhibitions, group exhibitions, and special projects. Many were published under Stalke Edition , while others were developed in close collaboration with the artists, who contributed texts, concepts, or graphic design. Some catalogues exist only in digital form, while others were printed in limited editions and are today available primarily as archival material. This overview serves as a navigational entry point to the catalogue archive. Each catalogue listed here is documented individually in separate archive items, where detailed publication information and full PDF versions are made available.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-11-overview-cataloguepdf', 'https://archive.org/details/a-11-overview-cataloguepdf', 'internet-archive:a-11-overview-cataloguepdf'),
  ('398651916747058564', 'Stalke Galleri – Artists Exhibited 1987–2025 (Complete Overview)', 'Stalke Galleri', 2026, 'History', 'The artists are organized according to their relationship to the exhibition history of Stalke Galleri and the Stalke Out Of Space projects, distinguishing between those who have played a sustained and central role in shaping the program, those with recurring or significant contributions, and artists represented through selected exhibitions and projects.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/a-12-artist-list-total-pdf', 'https://archive.org/details/a-12-artist-list-total-pdf', 'internet-archive:a-12-artist-list-total-pdf'),
