  ('722563235866764428', 'State of the Global Climate (2025)', 'World Meteorological Organization', 2026, 'Science', 'Crossing Earth''s Rubicon 🇺🇳 State of Global Climate (2025) - produced & published by the World Meteorological Organization (WMO) on March 23rd, 2026. Key Points: ▪ This WMO report confirms that 2015-2025 are the hottest 11-years on record, and that 2025 was the second or third hottest year on record (depending on the dataset ) at about 1.43°C above the 1850-1900 average. ▪ Over the past nine years, each year has set a new record for ocean heat content. Ocean warming has far-reaching consequences, such as degradation of marine ecosystems, biodiversity loss and reduction of the ocean carbon sink. ▪ Annual sea ice extent in the Arctic was at or near a record low, Antarctic sea ice extent was the third lowest on record and glacier melt continued unabated.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/state-of-the-global-climate-2025-1', 'https://archive.org/details/state-of-the-global-climate-2025-1', 'internet-archive:state-of-the-global-climate-2025-1'),
  ('263741482758464769', 'State Shinto, The Meiji Oligarchs'' Conscious Construction Of Imperial Divinity', 'Thomas J. Bryan, Claude/Anthropic', 2026, 'History', 'This study examines the construction of State Shinto (kokka shintō) in Meiji Japan (1868-1945) as a documented case of elite consciousness in belief system creation, analyzing how ruling oligarchs deliberately fabricated emperor worship through separation of Shinto from Buddhism (shinbutsu bunri), manufactured imperial divinity mythology, and deployed ideology through state education and shrine networks to mobilize 70+ million people for industrialization and military expansion. Unlike ancient examples where elite intent must be inferred, the Meiji oligarchs'' conscious construction is preserved in government records, educational policies, and contemporary accounts, providing modern documentation of the universal pattern where elites appropriate existing traditions, modify them for political purposes, and claim restoration while actually innovating. The case demonstrates belief as infrastructure for scaled power, documents the asymmetric consciousness between elite architects and sincere believers, and proves through post-1945 collapse that the system was state-maintained rather than organic tradition—offering the clearest historical evidence of elite consciousness in belief construction. This case study is part of the larger collection Patterns of Power: Systematic Analysis of Elite Control Mechanisms Across Civilizations , which applies an 8-part analytical framework across maximum historical variation to examine how elite power operates.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/state-shinto-the-meiji-oligarchs-conscious-construction-of-imperial-divinity', 'https://archive.org/details/state-shinto-the-meiji-oligarchs-conscious-construction-of-imperial-divinity', 'internet-archive:state-shinto-the-meiji-oligarchs-conscious-construction-of-imperial-divinity'),
