  ('136411619186691696', 'Stories From The Land Of Pratisham ( 1)', 'Prateek', 2026, 'Literature', '"Stories from the Land of Pratisham" is a 47-page literary collection by Prateek. This work features the feature-length poetic film script ''She Loved Me Softly,'' alongside the epic fantasy saga of Pratisham and the narrative of Karna . It explores themes of silent love, societal corruption, and personal resilience. This manuscript is an original creative work, formally documented with a DOI via OSF to protect intellectual property.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/stories-from-the-land-of-pratisham-1', 'https://archive.org/details/stories-from-the-land-of-pratisham-1', 'internet-archive:stories-from-the-land-of-pratisham-1'),
