  ('993692943353515786', 'Süper Dünyalar (Ansiklopedi)', 'Sahne Dünya', 2026, 'Science', 'Could Super-Earths truly be the stuff of our dreams? A Super-Earth is a source of curiosity for many, perhaps even the greatest paradise imaginable, but now it''s time to talk about the facts! Read the PDF to find out!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/super-dunyalar-ansiklopedi', 'https://archive.org/details/super-dunyalar-ansiklopedi', 'internet-archive:super-dunyalar-ansiklopedi'),
