  ('866816505659190292', 'Surkanda Devi Temple, Dhanaulti, Uttarakhand Compressed', 'Dr. M. Thirumaleshwar', 2026, 'History', 'A comprehensive, beautifully compiled guide to Surkanda Devi Temple (Kaddukhal, Dhanaulti, Tehri Garhwal, Uttarakhand) — one of the 51 Shakti Peethas of Goddess Sati. This PDF contains detailed information on: • Location, address, how to reach (road, ropeway & detailed trekking routes) • Legends, history and spiritual significance • Temple architecture, main & sub-deities • Daily rituals, special pujas, festivals and charges • Facilities for devotees, accommodation & nearby attractions • The sacred Devi Darshan Triangle (Surkanda + Kunjapuri + Chandrabadni) • High-quality photos, trekking details from IndiaHikes, and direct YouTube video links Compiled from authentic sources including official Uttarakhand tourism, Wikipedia, Google Gemini and personal research. Ideal for pilgrims, trekkers and devotees planning a visit to this serene high-altitude Himalayan temple at 2756 metres.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/surkanda-devi-temple-dhanaulti-uttarakhand-compressed', 'https://archive.org/details/surkanda-devi-temple-dhanaulti-uttarakhand-compressed', 'internet-archive:surkanda-devi-temple-dhanaulti-uttarakhand-compressed'),
