  ('826669006853481156', 'Survivor Library (survivorlibrary.com) - Traditional Skills and Knowledge Archive (11,855 Books)', 'SurvivorLibrary.com', 2026, 'History', 'A comprehensive digital archive of 11,855 essential survival, technical, and traditional knowledge resources organized into 13 hierarchical categories and 169 subcategories. This library preserves historical and practical information covering agriculture, medicine, engineering, construction, crafts, and traditional skills necessary for self-sufficiency and resilience. **Original Source:** https://www.survivorlibrary.com/ - This is a complete mirror of the Survivor Library website, reorganized into a hierarchical structure for easier navigation and long-term preservation. Content includes: Agriculture & Food (1,944 files), Medical & Health (802 files), Engineering & Technical (1,357 files), Construction & Building (608 files), Crafts & Manufacturing (1,238 files), Transportation (368 files), Science & Mathematics (535 files), Resources & Materials (477 files), Business & Finance (577 files), Education & Teaching (819 files), Arts & Culture (516 files), Lifestyle & Recreation (1,269 files), Reference & Miscellaneous (1,285 files). SAFETY WARNING: This collection contains historical texts on medicine, manufacturing, and survival skills. Some information (especially medical and chemical) may be outdated or dangerous. These texts are preserved for historical and informational purposes. Use caution and verify with modern sources where possible. All files are organized into a hierarchical structure for easy navigation. Most content is public domain or historical works predating 1928.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/SurvivorLibrary-com-Collection-2026', 'https://archive.org/details/SurvivorLibrary-com-Collection-2026', 'internet-archive:SurvivorLibrary-com-Collection-2026'),
