  ('856225335088039701', 'Tamilakam Politics And History Till The Sangam Period', 'Unknown', 2026, 'History', 'This book explores the political history of Tamilakam from the earliest times up to the Sangam Age. It examines the rule of the Chera, Chola, and Pandya kingdoms, local chieftains, governance systems, warfare, trade relations, and social structures. Based on Sangam literature, inscriptions, and archaeological sources, the work presents a comprehensive and source-based study of early Tamil political organization and state formation !', 'https://archive.org/services/img/tamilakam-politics-and-history-till-the-sangam-period', 'https://archive.org/details/tamilakam-politics-and-history-till-the-sangam-period', 'internet-archive:tamilakam-politics-and-history-till-the-sangam-period'),
