  ('365420445483574811', 'TAONOW JESUS 2.0 VillageIdiot 2026', 'Village_Idiot', 2026, 'Science', 'VillageIdiot_2026 and TAONOW_JESUS2.0 are "companion pieces" designed to be read together. They call for a re-framing of long-held beliefs (Paradigm Shifts) regarding the true nature of WATER, while questioning basic philosophical and spiritual beliefs of Western culture. Together, the two works present spiritual concepts regarding the Tao philosophy of Asia, while promoting a new understanding of Jesus of Nazareth. They offer a reinterpretation of Jesus'' original message of “love", viewed in the light of world history, current events, human aspirations and world-wide goals; while offering an alternative vision (a paradigm shift) in how we might view the world and our place in it.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/taonow-jesus-2.0_202603', 'https://archive.org/details/taonow-jesus-2.0_202603', 'internet-archive:taonow-jesus-2.0_202603'),
