  ('490955741615511240', 'Tareekh E Insani Rehaish Gahein', 'Yousuf Khan Abakhel Sadozai', 2026, 'History', 'This book discusses the different eras of human history, it focusses on the various types of human settlements in human history, from caves to countries and states.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/tareekh-e-insani-rehaish-gahein', 'https://archive.org/details/tareekh-e-insani-rehaish-gahein', 'internet-archive:tareekh-e-insani-rehaish-gahein'),
