  ('459521808135413084', 'Taste of Home What Can I Bring? Vol. 2: 300 Plus Recipes for Potlucks Bake Sales and Gatherings', 'Taste of Home', 2026, 'Non-Fiction', 'Wondering what dish to bring to your next big gathering? What Can I Bring Vol 2 has all the answers with over 300 recipes tailored for potlucks, bake sales, church suppers, and every bring-a-dish occasion. Whether you’re hosting a backyard barbecue or attending a family reunion, these recipes ensure you’ll always have the perfect contribution at your fingertips.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/oceanof-pdf.com-taste-of-home-what-can-i-bring-vol-2-taste-of-home', 'https://archive.org/details/oceanof-pdf.com-taste-of-home-what-can-i-bring-vol-2-taste-of-home', 'internet-archive:oceanof-pdf.com-taste-of-home-what-can-i-bring-vol-2-taste-of-home'),
