  ('435358519814403977', 'Tell me why', 'Saint Aimé', 2026, 'Human belief', 'Tell Me Why” is a philosophical novel exploring life, death, and human belief. Through the journey of a single life, it questions why joy greets birth, smiles follow growth, and tears mark departure. With reflective prose and poignant imagery, the novel challenges readers to confront the paradoxes of existence and the truths we often take for granted', 'https://archive.org/services/img/pdf-24-merged-1_202601', 'https://archive.org/details/pdf-24-merged-1_202601', 'internet-archive:pdf-24-merged-1_202601'),
