  ('688366327595217409', 'THE ADAGANA MANIFESTO - AMLIMA MAWUVI', 'Amlima Mawuvi', 2026, 'Science', 'This manifesto introduces Adagana, a sacred ancestral linguistic system embedded within Eʋe cosmology and Afrikan tonal traditions. Rather than a constructed or revived spoken language, Adagana is presented as a primordial activation code designed to encode cosmological intelligence, regulate spiritual practice, and preserve ancestral memory. The paper outlines Adagana’s origins, structural logic, prophetic significance, and contemporary relevance within Afrika and the Eʋe world, while emphasizing discipline, restraint, and ethical responsibility in its preservation and use.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/adagana-manifesto-amlima-mawuvi', 'https://archive.org/details/adagana-manifesto-amlima-mawuvi', 'internet-archive:adagana-manifesto-amlima-mawuvi'),
