  ('980883607718742303', 'The Blue Planet Earth', 'Anatoli Tomilin', 2026, 'Literature', 'A little book answering questions about the shape of the Earth, about day and night, about seasons and the planets. For children of primary school age Originally published in Russian by Malysh Publishing House, 1985 This English edition released on the web by The Mir Titles Project https://mirtitles.org Translation from the Russian by Damitr Mazanav Typset using Scribus Released under Creative Commons by Share Alike 4.0 License Contents What Did The Scientist Discover? What Did The Seafarers Prove? What Did The Cosmonaut See? What Did Artificial Satellites Help Us To Learn? How Dœs A Planet Diﬀer From A Star? Why Dœs A Planet Shine? WHY DŒS DAY REPLACE NIGHT? Why Is It Hot In Summer And Cold In Winter?', 'https://archive.org/services/img/anatoli-tomilin-the-blue-planet-earth-mir-titles-2026', 'https://archive.org/details/anatoli-tomilin-the-blue-planet-earth-mir-titles-2026', 'internet-archive:anatoli-tomilin-the-blue-planet-earth-mir-titles-2026'),
