  ('99749093174727624', 'The Cooks of Palomar Mountain', 'Peter Brueggeman', 2026, 'History', 'Who are Jeff and Will of Jeff Valley and Will Valley on the east side of Palomar Mountain? Jeff Valley is named after Jefferson Madison Cook, and Will Valley is named after William H. Cook, a son of Jefferson Cook from his first marriage. There were a lot of Cooks on Palomar Mountain, living there from 1877 to 1903.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/cook_20240608', 'https://archive.org/details/cook_20240608', 'internet-archive:cook_20240608'),
