  ('520490719857852577', 'The Desmier Family History revised 2025', 'R. E. Desmier', 2025, 'History', 'The Desmier Family History Revised 2025. This latest edition contains more detail on the Chatelier and Etridge families and a bit more about Jean Philippe Desmier in Pondicherry. Also included is an account about the trek from Burma to India during WW2 by Bollywood actress Helen and her mother Marie Desmier. Many original black and white photos have now been colourised and there is a chapter on DNA matching to my cousins. A surname index is included at the end.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/desmier-2025-for-archive-org_202502', 'https://archive.org/details/desmier-2025-for-archive-org_202502', 'internet-archive:desmier-2025-for-archive-org_202502'),
