  ('1147779677055673932', 'THE DOMINANT AUTHORITY 2', 'Faisal Mohammed Zaid Al-Sairam', 2026, 'Science', 'This book presents a logical and rational investigation into the limits of science and the origins of order, information, and consciousness. It does not ask the reader to believe, but to think. The work argues that randomness cannot generate functional information systems such as DNA, nor can blind processes produce purpose, responsibility, or meaning. The book explores the distinction between description and origin, mechanism and authority, and concludes that reality is governed by a dominant authority beyond material processes.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-dominant-authority-2', 'https://archive.org/details/the-dominant-authority-2', 'internet-archive:the-dominant-authority-2'),
