  ('635541476186616045', 'The Exquisite Corpse Adventure', 'Fredrick L. McKissack,Gregory Maguire,Jack Gantos,Jon Scieszka,Kate DiCamillo,Katherine Paterson,Lemony Snicket,Linda Sue Park,M. T. Anderson,Megan McDonald,Natalie Babbitt,Patricia C. McKissack,Shannon Hale,Steven Kellogg,Susan Cooper,', 2015, 'Mystery', 'This book is a collaborative, serialized children''s book by 15 well known authors in the tradition of the "Exquisite Corpse" writing and drawing game. Derived from: http://www.read.gov/exquisite-corpse/', 'https://archive.org/services/img/TheExquisiteCorpseAdventure', 'https://archive.org/details/TheExquisiteCorpseAdventure', 'internet-archive:TheExquisiteCorpseAdventure'),
