  ('939338506895435075', 'THE GEN AI', 'Dr. RAFFI MOHAMMED', 2026, 'Science', 'The Generative Revolution provides a concise yet powerful exploration of how Generative AI is transforming creativity, innovation, and human–machine interaction. Integrating insights from multiple disciplines, the volume examines core architectures, multimodal systems, and diverse applications across science, engineering, healthcare, and the arts. It also addresses key ethical and societal challenges while offering practical guidance for researchers, educators, technologists, and policymakers. This book serves as a timely roadmap to understanding the future of intelligent creativity and innovation. https://theiiet.com/the-generative-revolutionhow-ai-is-transforming-creativity-innovation-and-intelligence-isbn-978-81-993404-6-6-1st-january-2026/ https://explore.openaire.eu/search/result?pid=10.5281%2Fzenodo.17812503 https://zenodo.org/records/17812503 https://www.academia.edu/147712166/The_Generative_Revolution_How_AI_is_Transforming_Creativity_Innovation_and_Intelligence https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=ms2xEQAAQBAJ', 'https://archive.org/services/img/IIET-THE-GEN-AI', 'https://archive.org/details/IIET-THE-GEN-AI', 'internet-archive:IIET-THE-GEN-AI'),
