  ('876497154428016159', 'The Grave A Poem', 'Vivienne Wimmler & Chevalier D''Éon', 2025, 'Literature', '📖 "The grave is the golden gateway to heaven, where rich and poor alike must wait..." Dive into The Grave —a haunting poetic masterpiece by Vivienne Wimmler , illustrated by Chevalier D''Eon . This darkly lyrical work weaves themes of love, death, and judgment, framed by the enigmatic legacy of Rodrigo Granda. ✨ Why read it? A fusion of gothic poetry and visceral art Voices from beyond the grave confront a fractured soul A collector’s piece from the Wimmler Corporation Art Centre 🔍 Bibliographic Reference (APA 7th): Wimmler, V. (2025). The grave, a poem. Illustrated by Chevalier D''Eon. Wimmler Corporation Art Centre. 📚 Limited edition. Now archived internet archive. Title: The Grave, A Poem – Illustrated Edition (2025) Description: A poetic work by Vivienne Wimmler , accompanied by the visionary illustrations of Chevalier D''Eon . This piece explores themes of love, death, judgment, and legacy through a fragmented structure that blends lyrical verse, dramatic monologues, and controversial historical references (including an excerpt from Heinrich Himmler). Published by Wimmler Corporation Art Centre , this edition features: Core Texts : Bilingual elegies (English/Spanish), female voices from the underworld ( Beyond the Grave ), and odes to figures such as "the Caesar of New Babylon." Visual Material : 63 signed illustrations by D''Eon, merging alchemical symbolism with Gothic aesthetics. Editorial Context : Includes acknowledgments to the Fraternity of the Alchemists of the BLACK SUN and publication details from Ex Typographia Phaneinthymos (Mexico/London). Technical Details: Publication Date : March 13, 2025. Collaborators : Based on the "original inventions" of Rodrigo Granda . Digitisation : Preserved in PDF/A format (OCR enabled). Notes for Researchers: Contains intertextual references (literature, history, esotericism). Related to parallel projects: TRASMVTATO Digital Magazine and Phanerothyme Portfolio .', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-grave-a-poem', 'https://archive.org/details/the-grave-a-poem', 'internet-archive:the-grave-a-poem'),
