  ('467811236399412447', 'The Holy Bible UTV Definitive', 'Dallas James', 2026, 'Literature', 'The Holy Bible: Urim Thummim Version — Definitive Edition. A fresh translation from the Masoretic Text arranged in the Dominion Order: a seven-division structure (The Law, Prophets, The Writings, Pentateuch, General, Paul, Revelation) restoring the Enochic witness (Enoch, 1 Enoch, Jubilees) immediately after Genesis, before the Law of Moses. This 52-book, 32,455-verse corpus follows Dr. Ernest L. Martin''s manuscript research. The Definitive Edition is the purest reading experience — continuous flowing prose with no visible chapter breaks or verse numbers. Scripture reads as the authors originally composed it, as uninterrupted narrative, poetry, prophecy, and epistle. Hidden anchors preserve verse-level navigation for readers who want to locate specific passages. Translated by Dallas James. Hearts2Fathers Publishing, Royal Levitical Priesthood Ministry.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-holy-bible-utv-definitive', 'https://archive.org/details/the-holy-bible-utv-definitive', 'internet-archive:the-holy-bible-utv-definitive'),
