  ('845817014331719645', 'The Infinite Odyssey: Audio Adventures - Audio Edition', 'Esa Myllylä', 2026, 'Science', 'Embark on a high-stakes educational journey with the Knowledge Guardians! Aboard the Voyager-7, Leo, Maya, and Pip travel through time and space to protect the world’s facts from the bumbling Error-Bots, Glitch and Blip. Narrated by the interactive AI Ava, each standalone episode challenges listeners to solve STEM-based puzzles, from decoding ancient Incan logic to mastering fractions in deep space. It is a thrilling, screen-free adventure perfect for ages 7+ that makes learning history, math, and science truly legendary.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-infinite-odyssey-audio-ad-esa-myllyla', 'https://archive.org/details/the-infinite-odyssey-audio-ad-esa-myllyla', 'internet-archive:the-infinite-odyssey-audio-ad-esa-myllyla'),
