  ('72858741538759282', 'The Inheritance Games', 'LeafPool', 2025, 'Young Adult', '"The Inheritance Games" by Jennifer Lynn Barnes is a young adult mystery novel where Avery Kylie Grambs, a high school student, unexpectedly inherits a fortune from a billionaire she''s never met. To claim her inheritance, Avery must live at Hawthorne House, a sprawling mansion filled with riddles and puzzles, while also navigating the complex and competitive Hawthorne family, who are also dispossessed of their inheritance.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/1680577542-the-inheritance-games-5', 'https://archive.org/details/1680577542-the-inheritance-games-5', 'internet-archive:1680577542-the-inheritance-games-5'),
  ('945461047492880587', 'The Inheritors', 'William Golding', 1955, 'Science Fiction', 'The Inheritors by William Golding. A science fiction book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2430152W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL2430152W-'),
  ('771100136176884949', 'The Inheritors', 'William Golding', 1955, 'Science Fiction', 'The Inheritors by William Golding', 'https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/376497-L.jpg', 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL2430152W', 'internet-archive:ol-works-OL2430152W'),
  ('480396386736448193', 'The Ink Black Heart', 'Robert Galbraith', 2022, 'Mystery', 'When frantic, disheveled Edie Ledwell appears in the office begging to speak to her, private detective Robin Ellacott doesn’t know quite what to make of the situation. The co-creator of a popular cartoon, The Ink Black Heart, Edie is being persecuted by a mysterious online figure who goes by the pseudonym of Anomie. Edie is desperate to uncover Anomie’s true identity. Robin decides that the agency can’t help with this—and thinks nothing more of it until a few days later, when she reads the shocking news that Edie has been tasered and then murdered in Highgate Cemetery, the location of The Ink Black Heart. Robin and her business partner, Cormoran Strike, become drawn into the quest to uncover Anomie’s true identity. But with a complex web of online aliases, business interests and family conflicts to navigate, Strike and Robin find themselves embroiled in a case that stretches their powers of deduction to the limits – and which threatens them in new and horrifying ways', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-ink-black-heart-a-cormoran-strike-novel-robert--annas-archive--libgenrs-fic-2491828', 'https://archive.org/details/the-ink-black-heart-a-cormoran-strike-novel-robert--annas-archive--libgenrs-fic-2491828', 'internet-archive:the-ink-black-heart-a-cormoran-strike-novel-robert--annas-archive--libgenrs-fic-2491828'),
