  ('708337347871415879', 'The Iron Defence: Clinical and Psychoanalytical Analysis of Transgenerational Trauma (Independent Documentation Series, 2026)', 'Peter Siegfried Krug', 2026, 'History', '"The Iron Defence" (28 pages, bilingual: German/English). It is a foundational component of the Independent Documentation Series Research Focus: The documentation analyzes the "Iron Defence"—a specific trauma compensation mechanism characterized by hyper-functionality and rigid control rather than social decline. Based on the biographical record of Herta Brigitte Bertel (1943–2024) , it explores how survivors of institutional and rural exploitation (Verdingkinder) use professional duty and social status to suppress traumatic fragmentation.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/iron-defence', 'https://archive.org/details/iron-defence', 'internet-archive:iron-defence'),
