  ('202364652229708763', 'The Kid By The Side Of The Road JUAN O SAVIN', 'JUAN O SAVIN', 2020, 'History', 'This colorful pre-election magazine-style focuses on waking up the sheep by explaining the historical context of the economic slavery created by the globalist control structure. Very well-written with artistically illustrated backdrops on every page, it presents the core mechanisms of bribery, coersion and blackmail used to compromise officials and power brokers into seditious acts. It provides a pep talk for motivating change spiced with juicy, seldom heard tidbits from a seasoned researcher. The pdf format is a very showy presentation compared to the epub conversion. This is clean and bookmarked. Table of contents : CHAPTER ONE: THE KID BY THE SIDE OF THE ROAD CHAPTER TWO: ALL PATRIOTS MUST LISTEN! CHAPTER THREE: Q SENTINELS TEAM VERSUS OSIRIS 17 TEAMS CHAPTER FOUR: SILVERY THREADS AND PURIM DREAMS', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-kid-by-the-side-of-the-road-juan-o-savin', 'https://archive.org/details/the-kid-by-the-side-of-the-road-juan-o-savin', 'internet-archive:the-kid-by-the-side-of-the-road-juan-o-savin'),
