  ('489064731802457635', 'The Legacy of the Marked Ones - Traumatic Symmetries (Erbe der Gezeichneten)', 'Peter Siegfried Krug', 2026, 'History', 'This document provides a radical documentation of institutional abuse in Austria. It analyzes the traumatic symmetries in the biographies of three individuals: Franz Josef Stangl, Robert Volek, and Peter Siegfried Krug (born November 23, 1966, in Salzburg) . Core Concepts: Cold Mother: Emotional absence as a precursor to institutional violence. Paternal Vacancy / Identity Theft: The concealment of the father (Dr. Peter Strobl) as a tool of repression. Bourgeois Camouflage: The social facade used to hide domestic and institutional crimes. Mission Statement: This publication serves the duty of documentation and the fight against collective forgetting.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/erbe-der-gezeichneten', 'https://archive.org/details/erbe-der-gezeichneten', 'internet-archive:erbe-der-gezeichneten'),
