  ('62346419654947475', 'The Light Of The Lantern', 'Jadden Couture', 2026, 'Historical Fiction', 'A multi-generational saga following Wallace T. Garrison, a visionary filmmaker who rises from humble beginnings in 1960s Vancouver to global acclaim . Alongside his wife Anastasia, they build a legacy based on "slow fashion," family by choice, and the enduring power of visual storytelling .', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-light-of-the-lantern', 'https://archive.org/details/the-light-of-the-lantern', 'internet-archive:the-light-of-the-lantern'),
