  ('960072645880524430', 'The Little Mermaid (Read It Yourself with Ladybird-Level 4)', 'Ronne Randall', 2014, 'The Little Mermaid ---Read it yourself with Ladybird---Juvenile fiction', 'The Little Mermaid (Read It Yourself with Ladybird-Level 4) Publisher ‏ : ‎ Ladybird; UK ed. edition (August 26, 2014) Language ‏ : ‎ English Paperback ‏ : ‎ 48 pages ISBN-10 ‏ : ‎ 0723280703 ISBN-13 ‏ : ‎ 978-0723280705 Reading age ‏ : ‎ 3 - 5 years by Ladybird (Author), Milly Teggle (Illustrator)', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-little-mermaid_202306', 'https://archive.org/details/the-little-mermaid_202306', 'internet-archive:the-little-mermaid_202306'),
  ('501903151436647690', 'The Little Prince Antoine De Saint Exupery', 'Saint-Exupéry, Antoine de & Howard, Richard', 2011, 'Fiction', 'Authors: Antoine de Saint-Exupéry &amp; Richard Howard SUMMARY: Few stories are as widely read and as universally cherished by children and adults alike as The Little Prince. Richard Howard''s new translation of the beloved classic-published to commemorate the 100th anniversary of Antoine de Saint-Exupéry''s birth-beautifully reflects Saint-Exupéry''s unique and gifted style. Howard, an acclaimed poet and one of the preeminent translators of our time, has excelled in bringing the English text as close as possible to the French, in language, style, and most important, spirit.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-little-prince-antoine-de-saint-exupery', 'https://archive.org/details/the-little-prince-antoine-de-saint-exupery', 'internet-archive:the-little-prince-antoine-de-saint-exupery'),
