  ('930170463674977607', 'The Lost Science Of Money; The Mythology Of Money And Story Of Power ( 2002) - Stephen Zarlenga', 'Zarlenga, Stephen', 2002, 'History', 'The Lost Science Of Money; The Mythology Of Money And Story Of Power (2002) - Stephen Zarlenga A MUST READ for anyone wanting to know the truth about the Banking system today. The top bankers keep us ignorant on purpose and have funded disinformation and false economic theories to keep the public and even the serious researchers ignorant of how the monetary system really works. How money is created, and how money really interacts and impacts with people and the economy in General. This book also debunks any notion and disinormation about Hitler and the National Socialists working for the Rothschild bankers and being in the pockets of Big Business. In fact Hitler and the National Socialists, Mussolini and the Italian Fascists , and other Fascist/ Nationalist-populist movements in the world in general in the first half of the 20th century. Such as the British Union of Fascists led by Sir. Oswald Mosley were against the Rothschild banks. They knew that they had wrecked their nation. This book show the true history of money and the conspiracies and world events that have been shaped by money power. The book is extensively researched and incredibly well cited.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/StephenZarlengaTheLostScienceOfMoneyScan44Mb', 'https://archive.org/details/StephenZarlengaTheLostScienceOfMoneyScan44Mb', 'internet-archive:StephenZarlengaTheLostScienceOfMoneyScan44Mb'),
