  ('755750368012756054', 'The Maples Of Hollow Brook Anya Tiosa', 'Ovi eBook Publishing', 2026, 'eBook', 'It was a cold January evening when Eli Tannen walked down the worn-out dirt road that led to the edge of the Hollow Brook forest, where the maples stood in their quiet, eternal rows. His boots crunched against the frost as the wind cut through his threadbare coat. He hadn''t been down this path in over a year, not since his father passed and left him the family business. And even then, Eli had never been keen on leaving the warmth of the stove or the comforting hum of his maple syrup boiling away in the barn.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-maples-of-hollow-brook-anya-tiosa', 'https://archive.org/details/the-maples-of-hollow-brook-anya-tiosa', 'internet-archive:the-maples-of-hollow-brook-anya-tiosa'),
