  ('36770744081158201', 'THE MASTER KEY: A Forensic Analysis of the Biblical Technical Briefing', 'Eric Paul Rogers', 2026, 'Science', 'This book is not a religious work; it is a fusion of Religion and Science and a forensic report of universal history. By applying the "Master Key," we realize that the King James Bible is a documented technical briefing provided by the Creator. The core premise is the "Sinai Download"—the argument that the Pentateuch was a direct, visual playback from God to Moses on Mount Sinai. This "download" archived history from the Big Bang to the dinosaurs as a forensic report to ensure the truth remained "clean" from human tradition or iniquity. Key Forensic Handshakes included: • Genesis 1:1 & The Big Bang: The technical reality of the Singularity. • The Nephilim Reality: Identifying the prehistoric era and dinosaurs within the biblical timeline. • The Noahic Knowledge: Noah as the missing link between ancient "cavemen" and modern humanity. • The Godhead & The New Heart: The technical blueprints for the future of the human prototype.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-master-key-final-260128-181752', 'https://archive.org/details/the-master-key-final-260128-181752', 'internet-archive:the-master-key-final-260128-181752'),
