  ('68073421294376970', 'The Math That Made The Map Book I Keplers First Law The Tilted Circle', 'Ma’Ka Yuchii', 2026, 'Science', 'The first book in the 100-book science challenge series by Ma’Ka Yuchii. Part of Edition 1 — The Dismantling. This series asks one question the educational system never asked: who checked the work? Released freely by Ma’Ka Yuchii Tsoyaha — the mother spirit — the protector of the laws of the land and the preservation of life — restoring my ancestors’ knowledge to the world it was taken from. March 21, 2026. Spring Equinox.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-math-that-made-the-map-book-i-keplers-first-law-the-tilted-circle', 'https://archive.org/details/the-math-that-made-the-map-book-i-keplers-first-law-the-tilted-circle', 'internet-archive:the-math-that-made-the-map-book-i-keplers-first-law-the-tilted-circle'),
