  ('789561256406637022', 'THE MATRIX BREAKING THE MILLENNIAL CODE En US', 'Rui Almeida', 2026, 'Mystery', 'WHO AM I? WHAT AM I DOING HERE? WHAT IS GOD? Who am I? A free spirit who was born in a golden cage called "inherited faith" and chose to break it. I am not an academic, I am not a guru, I am not a prophet. I am simply someone who decided to read the texts the Church burned and ask: why? What am I doing here? I seek verifiable historical truth, not the comfort of convenient belief. I read ancient documents, confront chronologies, follow the trail of knowledge that survived burning libraries and bloody inquisitions. And I share what I find — not to convert anyone, but to liberate those who are ready. What is God? God is not the bearded tyrant who demands obedience, nor the celestial judge who counts sins. God is the principle that exists before any name, the consciousness that pulses in everything that lives, the good you do when no one is watching. God does not need temples, priests, or intermediaries. God is within you — always has been. And no institution can sell you access to what is already yours by right of existence. This book is my answer to those who tried to rob me of that truth. Rui Almeida', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-matrix-breaking-the-millennial-code-en-us', 'https://archive.org/details/the-matrix-breaking-the-millennial-code-en-us', 'internet-archive:the-matrix-breaking-the-millennial-code-en-us'),
