  ('382320560385222654', 'The Missing Tome Thanos Kalamidas', 'Ovi eBook Publishing', 2026, 'Mystery', 'Three crime and mystery stories featuring Constable Karl Blom of the Växjö police station. A unique character with distinctive qualities. Karl Blom spoke little, a habit honed in the quiet corridors of the Växjö police station. At thirty, his life was one of quiet routines, a small studio apartment, the familiar walk to work, and the steady companionship of his girlfriend Ida, who understood his silences. The missing tome The silent inheritance The Evedal alibi', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-missing-tome-thanos-kalamidas', 'https://archive.org/details/the-missing-tome-thanos-kalamidas', 'internet-archive:the-missing-tome-thanos-kalamidas'),
