  ('172528127104328021', 'The qArchive#1 Zine', 'qArchive cabal', 2026, 'History', 'The qArchive is a zine about queer history&culture emerged from the depths Russian queer underground. Yeah, we still exist after they proclaimed us "extremists" and turned us into second-class citizens. Our first issues will be centered around the birth of early ru queer/transgender web-culture in late 90''– early 00'' and interesting personas, clubs and personal stories of queer-becoming all of which nowadays are largely obscure and forgotten. Feel free to share it with your trusted friends and researchers. You may also reach us via email on the last page!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/q-archive-1', 'https://archive.org/details/q-archive-1', 'internet-archive:q-archive-1'),
