  ('183629229378015415', 'The Rudder August 2025', 'U.S. Navy. Medical Service Corps', 2025, 'History', 'From the MSC Director M. CASE Rear Admiral, Medical Service Corps United States Navy Director, Medical Service Corps CORPS CHIEF’S OFFICE FY25 OFFICER OF THE YEAR ANNOUNCEMENT NAVY MEDICINE PROJECT MANAGEMENT TRAINING (PMPE) NEW JUNIOR OFFICER SEABAG AND CAREER DEVELOPMENT BOARD (CDB) POLICY BRIEF HISTORY OF THE MSC RESERVES By: Mr. Andre Sobocinski, BUMED Historian, and Lt. Katie Parizek, MSC, USN PHARMACY OVERSEAS DELIVERING CARE By: Lt. Karla M. Liendo, Director Resources Management, Naval Hospital Rota, Spain NAMRU SAN ANTONIO RESEARCHERS COLLABORATE FOR NOVEL BONE FRACTURE FIXATION TECHNOLOGY By: Burrell Parmer, NAMRU San Antonio Public Affairs TAKING THE UNCONVENTIONAL PATH: THE STORY OF VALENTINO BAILEY By: André B. Sobocinski, BUMED Historian NMRLC SERVICE MEMBER RISES FROM ENLISTED CORPSMAN TO NAVY CAPTAIN By: Julius Evans, Public Affairs Officer, Naval Medical Readiness Logistics Command BIRTHDAY MESSAGES', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-rudder-august-2025-final', 'https://archive.org/details/the-rudder-august-2025-final', 'internet-archive:the-rudder-august-2025-final'),
