  ('1085745786166800035', 'The Sinai Download Decoding The Truth of the King James Bible', 'Eric Paul Rogers', 2026, 'History', 'This document provides the "Master Key" to understanding the link between Ancient Scripture and Modern Science. Based on the King James Version (KJV), "The Sinai Download" archives the direct, visual playback given to Moses on Mount Sinai. Key Discoveries Include: The Big Bang/Genesis Connection: A technical breakdown of the origins of the universe. Forensic Paleontology: The identity of the Nephilim as the dinosaurs of the fossil record. The Missing Link: Noah as the bridge between "cavemen" and modern humanity. The Godhead Formula: A mathematical and spiritual analysis of the Father (Source), the Son (The Bridge), and the Body (The Bride). This is not a book of beliefs, but a documented technical briefing from the only One who was there. Designed for those seeking the "Clean Truth" beyond institutional static.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/sinai-download-eric-rogers', 'https://archive.org/details/sinai-download-eric-rogers', 'internet-archive:sinai-download-eric-rogers'),
  ('389275730464837396', 'The Sincere Liberators, Why Jesus, Marx, And Buddha Were Fighting The Same Battle', 'Thomas J. Bryan, Claude/Anthropic', 2026, 'History', 'This comparative analysis examines Jesus of Nazareth, Karl Marx, and Gautama Buddha as sincere liberators who fought identical battles against elite appropriation of belief systems for control, yet whose teachings were posthumously coopted to reconstruct the very hierarchies they opposed. The essay demonstrates how all three understood belief infrastructure as a mechanism of elite power (Temple/priestly systems, capitalist ideology, Brahmin caste hierarchy), lived consistently with their liberatory teachings without seeking wealth or power, and died as threats to ruling classes—only to have their movements transformed through Elite Darwinism into new domination systems (Christianity under Constantine, Soviet communism, state Buddhism). The analysis argues that the universal pattern of cooption—where Christianity reconstructed the Temple mediation Jesus fought, Soviet bureaucracy reconstructed the class hierarchy Marx opposed, and monastic Buddhism reconstructed the Brahmin priesthood Buddha renounced—vindicates their understanding of belief as infrastructure while tragically demonstrating that even brilliant, sincere liberation theologies cannot escape institutional capture by power-seeking elites. This comparative theoretical essay is part of the larger collection Patterns of Power: Systematic Analysis of Elite Control Mechanisms Across Civilizations , which examines how belief systems function as infrastructure for elite control across maximum historical variation.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-sincere-liberators-why-jesus-marx-and-buddha-were-fighting-the-same-battle', 'https://archive.org/details/the-sincere-liberators-why-jesus-marx-and-buddha-were-fighting-the-same-battle', 'internet-archive:the-sincere-liberators-why-jesus-marx-and-buddha-were-fighting-the-same-battle'),
