  ('520228333478033365', 'The Stand', 'Stephen King', 1978, 'Science Fiction', 'The Stand by Stephen King. A science fiction book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81618W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL81618W-'),
  ('695226205244859710', 'The Stand', 'Stephen King', 1978, 'Science Fiction', 'The Stand by Stephen King', 'https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/9255992-L.jpg', 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL81618W', 'internet-archive:ol-works-OL81618W'),
  ('550745007363944560', 'The Stand-Alone Western Novels Written by Leonard F. Meares', 'Anders N. Nilsson', 2026, 'Literature', 'Best remembered for his long series of novels about Larry & Stretch and Big Jim/Nevada Jim, the Australian western author Leonard F. Meares (1921-1993) also got published about 200 stand-alone novels. Today very rare, these novels from Cleveland Publishing appeared in different series of cheap novel magazines, chiefly Cleveland Western and Cougar Western between 1955 and 1966. Selected titles were published in translation in the Nordic countries, most of them in Finland. Based on the 15 titles read in Swedish translation, Meares'' stand-alone novels give a more varied view of his authorship than the more formulaic and episodic Larry & Stretch adventures do. All known titles and editions are listed, both alphabetically and chronologically. 15 of them are also reviewed, and a selection of cover scans from Australia, Norway and Sweden are reproduced.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/nilsson_2026_meares_standalone', 'https://archive.org/details/nilsson_2026_meares_standalone', 'internet-archive:nilsson_2026_meares_standalone'),
  ('372612605097554914', 'The star beast', 'Robert A. Heinlein', 1954, 'Science Fiction', 'The star beast by Robert A. Heinlein. A science fiction book.', null, 'https://openlibrary.org/works/OL59720W', 'internet-archive:ol-_works_OL59720W-'),
