  ('991885556596340394', 'The Ultimate History Of Video Games (Vol 1) Errata', 'Ethan Johnson', 2025, 'History', 'A collection of errata and notes taken from a readthrough of The Ultimate History of Video Games (Vol. 1) by Steven L. Kent. This supplement is intended for those interested in video game history to identify errors within the book and use it as a more useful resource. Video game history has advanced well beyond the understanding of what was printed in The First Quarter (2000) and The Ultimate History of Video Games (2001), therefore this document helps correct misunderstandings often traceable to this seminal work. This endeavor is undertaken in respect of - not denigration of - the original author and his work. See a fuller explanation of the issues with this book in my blog post . Thank you to those of the Gaming Alexandria community for helping identify issues in our readthrough. View the entire readthrough series here . Please feel free to comment any additional corrections needed; this will be updated in the future.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/the-ultimate-history-of-video-games-vol-1-errata', 'https://archive.org/details/the-ultimate-history-of-video-games-vol-1-errata', 'internet-archive:the-ultimate-history-of-video-games-vol-1-errata'),
