  ('649367074649032954', 'The Walt Disney Co. 2024 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'Walt Disney Company', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report & Form 10-K, Proxy Statement and Chairman''s message to stockholders for The Walt Disney Company (Ticker: DIS). The corporation founded on October 16, 1923 is an American multinational, mass media and entertainment conglomerate headquartered at the Walt Disney Studios complex in Burbank, California. Former company names include Disney Brothers Studio, Walt Disney Studio and Walt Disney Productions.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/walt-disney-company-dis-proxy-statement-2025-03-20', 'https://archive.org/details/walt-disney-company-dis-proxy-statement-2025-03-20', 'internet-archive:walt-disney-company-dis-proxy-statement-2025-03-20'),
