  ('899908808712490608', 'The world In The Turmoil, Climate change, Fake News, Kids and Screens, Big Tech and Uncertainty Exploring how we got there', 'GNSECBooks, Z-Library', 2019, 'History', 'The world In The Turmoil, Climate change, Fake News, Kids and Screens, Big Tech and Uncertainty_ Exploring how we got there. There are key ideas and Theories of liberalism and Laisez Faire Capitalism that got us into Trouble. we see Nationalism on the rise. So what can we do to fix the mess? I tried to dig deep and see what we can read and hopefully that get us out of the hole. Enjoy reading.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/HistoryOfTheoriesAndIdeologiesThatGotUsInTheTurmoil', 'https://archive.org/details/HistoryOfTheoriesAndIdeologiesThatGotUsInTheTurmoil', 'internet-archive:HistoryOfTheoriesAndIdeologiesThatGotUsInTheTurmoil'),
