  ('1018364239320181393', 'TheLexiconImperium', 'Various Authors', 2017, 'History', 'This library contains hidden and forbidden knowledge hidden away and censored from the public which gives you insight on what their true agendas while also containing books whom teach basic knowledge of politics and economics which you are obligated to learn to learn before delving into the latter. This library also contains the bloodiest and grimmest of grimoires containing rituals in which the magus can use to conquer this wretched planet, but beware for this has proven to be a treacherous, for the magus could unleash the most hideous anti-gods from dimensions which hath not been discovered or could even become a rancid beast himself! As a curious neophyte you are obligated to learn the basics of the art of magick. Do you dare to follow this path? If not, turn back now.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/TheLexiconImperium', 'https://archive.org/details/TheLexiconImperium', 'internet-archive:TheLexiconImperium'),
