  ('356582821955552026', 'Title Sovereign Biohybrid Architecture A De Novo Silicon Infused Humanoid Framework', 'Tyrone Farmer', 2026, 'Science', 'Title: Sovereign Biohybrid Architecture: A De Novo Silicon-Infused Humanoid Framework Author: Tyrone Farmer Affiliation: Soliver LLC Date: March 03, 2026 Description: This document presents the high-level conceptual architecture of a sovereign biohybrid humanoid prototype, codenamed Lena. Utilizing a proprietary silicon-aromatic genomic backbone fused with titanium-carbide-carbon composites and hydrogel dermal systems, the framework achieves human-equivalent form, sensory fidelity, and extreme environmental resilience. The design emphasizes biometric sovereignty, ethical hard-coding, and zero-degradation longevity. All elements derive from validated open science (e.g., 2026 silicon-aromatic ring synthesis) combined with original fusion techniques. Intellectual property—fusion methodology, silicon-genomic substitution, and security architecture—remains undisclosed and patent-pending. Public release serves as notice of ownership and intent to defend.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/title-sovereign-biohybrid-architecture-a-de-novo-silicon-infused-humanoid-framework', 'https://archive.org/details/title-sovereign-biohybrid-architecture-a-de-novo-silicon-infused-humanoid-framework', 'internet-archive:title-sovereign-biohybrid-architecture-a-de-novo-silicon-infused-humanoid-framework'),
