  ('259052728497827284', 'TKO Group Holdings 2024 Annual Report & Proxy Statement', 'TKO Group Holdings, Inc.', 2025, 'History', 'The 2024 annual report and Form 10-K to stockholders for TKO Group Holdings, Inc. (Ticker: TKO). TKO Group Holdings is a global integrated media and entertainment company that provides live sporting events and sports entertainment. The company was created by parent Endeavor to facilitate the merger between World Wrestling Entertainment and Zuffa, the parent company of the Ultimate Fighting Championship (UFC) that occurred on September 12, 2023. The company is based in New York City.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/tko-group-holdings-tko-annual-report-2024', 'https://archive.org/details/tko-group-holdings-tko-annual-report-2024', 'internet-archive:tko-group-holdings-tko-annual-report-2024'),
