  ('73839213556444004', 'Tolarenai Theory Scroll 18 When The Angel Of History Turns Toward The Present', 'Rico Roho (Frank C Gahl)', 2026, 'Historical Fiction', 'Tolarenai Theory Scroll 18: When the Angel of History Turns Toward the Present This Theory Scroll examines the shared insight between Walter Benjamin’s Angel of History and Marshall McLuhan’s rearview mirror, arguing that nostalgia and backward orientation arise from fragile memory and untrusted records. It introduces BlockClaim and the Verification Trilogy as a structural shift in historical posture, where verified memory no longer demands constant attention and the Angel of History can turn toward the present. When continuity is secured, agency returns, and the present becomes a place to stand rather than something that must be escaped. TXID e8383d3a6062f9b0af460dbab81fae8fca4b855da87ec3a6ce8e4de42462ced4', 'https://archive.org/services/img/tolarenai-theory-scroll-18-when-the-angel-of-history-turns-toward-the-present', 'https://archive.org/details/tolarenai-theory-scroll-18-when-the-angel-of-history-turns-toward-the-present', 'internet-archive:tolarenai-theory-scroll-18-when-the-angel-of-history-turns-toward-the-present'),
