  ('628885279410889950', 'Transcription Of 1967 First Edition Of Alma Lewis James Book Stuffed Clubs And Antimaccassars', 'Dale C. Maley', 2026, 'History', 'Alma Lewis James did a 1st Edition in 1967 and a 2nd Edition in 1977. The 1967 edition contains a lot of rare information about William T. Stackpole and the 2nd edition has almost no information about him. I transcribed this 1st Edition to preserve Alma''s very valuable historic information about Fairbury Illinois. Dale C. Maley Fairbury IL Historian March 24, 2026', 'https://archive.org/services/img/transcription-of-1967-first-edition-of-alma-lewis-james-book-stuffed-clubs-and-antimaccassars', 'https://archive.org/details/transcription-of-1967-first-edition-of-alma-lewis-james-book-stuffed-clubs-and-antimaccassars', 'internet-archive:transcription-of-1967-first-edition-of-alma-lewis-james-book-stuffed-clubs-and-antimaccassars'),
