  ('253133556601095517', 'Treasured Dead Thanos Kalamidas', 'Ovi eBook Publishing', 2026, 'Thriller', 'An hour before sunset, on the kind of cool October evening that makes you remember every poor decision you ever made, a man on a motorcycle entered the town he’d sworn he’d left for good. The few persons who were at their windows regarded this traveller with a sort of distrust, which was fair, because I regarded the town with the same suspicion.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/treasured-dead-thanos-kalamidas', 'https://archive.org/details/treasured-dead-thanos-kalamidas', 'internet-archive:treasured-dead-thanos-kalamidas'),
  ('298482065352463151', 'Treasury Of Truth Illustrated Dhammapada Sinhalese Version', 'Ven. Weragoda Sarada Thero', 2013, 'Literature', 'Treasury of Truth - Illustrated Dhammapada – Sinhalese Version ( “Dharma bhandagaraya – Situwam sahita Dhammapadaya”) Author: Ven. Weragoda Sarada Maha Thero. Editor: Mr. Edwin Ariyadasa Illustrations: Mr. P. Wickramanayaka Designs & line drawings: Piyaratna Hewabatage Among the greatest publications in the history of Buddhism; "Treasury of Truth - Illustrated Dhammapada" Sinhalese Version is a monumental work. • Over 900 pages of A4 size. • Adorned with 423 illustrations in full-colour, at the rate of one especially commissioned illustration for each stanza. Weighs 4 kg. Included in the text are Pali stanza in Roman Characters - literal translation of stanza - Popular translation - original story out of which stanza stems and commentaries on words, expressions and concepts. ISBN: 981-00-4938-2', 'https://archive.org/services/img/treasury-of-truth-illustrated-dhammapada-sinhalese-version', 'https://archive.org/details/treasury-of-truth-illustrated-dhammapada-sinhalese-version', 'internet-archive:treasury-of-truth-illustrated-dhammapada-sinhalese-version'),
