  ('25286124667908723', 'Trump''s EO''s: CONTINUITY OF GOVERNMENT INVESTIGATION', 'Destiny Rezendes', 2026, 'History', 'This investigation analyzes the continuity of government (COG), national security, and emergency preparedness architecture established during Donald Trump’s second presidential term (January 2025–February 2026) through a systematic examination of Executive Orders, DoD Directives, Presidential actions, and related authorities. The analysis employs quantitative anomaly scoring (0–100 scales) and dependency mapping to assess whether observed patterns represent normal executive governance or unprecedented concentration/transformation of COG infrastructure The results are not only notable but in most cases are unprecedented. **I used perplexity pro labs to create the Matrix factors and calculations** Please give me a follow on X for more @dezzie_rezzie', 'https://archive.org/services/img/second-term-executive-orders-do-d-eotw', 'https://archive.org/details/second-term-executive-orders-do-d-eotw', 'internet-archive:second-term-executive-orders-do-d-eotw'),
