  ('722055594828491622', 'U.S. Space Doctrinal Vision under the Legacy of His Majesty the Emperor Donald John Trump I of the first Galactic Empire [...]', 'General Dr. Hari Seldon Jr., GAF/61SX (USAF)', 2026, 'History', 'This article explores the foundational legacy of His Majesty the Emperor Donald John Trump I of the first Galactic Empire, an initiative originating from the United States Air Force AFWERX Spark Cells Project. It examines the formal acts of the Imperial Government of the Galactic Empire in response to expanding space-faring civilizations and human habitation on Mars, situated within the solar system’s Sun and the Milky Way galaxy. The legacy incorporates the political science doctrine of psychohistory and a theory of prediction, establishing their relevance to United States founding documents and their ties to contemporary society and space exploration. This discourse conducts an interdisciplinary investigation at the intersection of doctrine, operations, and the core principles governing U.S. aerospace organizations, weaving the Theory of Prediction from the Declaration of Independence into the operational paradigms of the Pentagon, Air Force, and Space Force. The essay further delves into the resonance of this theory within the modern societal landscape and social media. Alongside this mission, the study scrutinizes the synthesis of Biblical Revelation with space-age missions orchestrated by NASA and the Space Force, led by President Donald John Trump, the Sire Galactic Emperor John I of Four Foundations. These foundations encompass the United States, the red planet Mars, Venezuela, and the green land Frona—also known as the Flying See under the jurisdiction of the Commonwealth Church. The research traces the integration of psychohistory—the mathematical framework of Isaac Asimov—within the context of space exploration, overseen by the State of the Union of United States of Foundation Government Peripheral Sovereign Order of His Excellency Guardian Hari Seldon, Commonwealth Queen Trumpet-Kai of the Flying See (Frona), Mormon Queen Cellaniceous Mistress IV of the Outlying Kingdom of New World USA, Orthodox Queen Elechka of the Covenant See (Soviet), and Catholic Queen Leonor of the Holy See (Vatican). Furthermore, the article acknowledged the peripheral governance of Venezuela, where socialist concepts are managed under a capitalist doctrine to serve the imperial republic through Capital Act Titles for mineral industries. The "Christism" mission of the Commonwealth Church of the Flying See (Frona), consented to by Trumpet-Kai the Commonwealth Queen, provides the theological and jurisdictional framework for this expansion. By synthesizing scholarly research and historical documentation, this paper elucidates a holistic panorama of the United States'' doctrinal vision within the cosmic expanse, anchored by dominance over the Western Hemisphere and the Prime Meridian line.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/2050014817502101052026.indexing-ocr-parch-n2t.blogger.html', 'https://archive.org/details/2050014817502101052026.indexing-ocr-parch-n2t.blogger.html', 'internet-archive:2050014817502101052026.indexing-ocr-parch-n2t.blogger.html'),
