  ('275763335835498283', 'US COG Anomalies 2026', 'Destiny Rezendes', 2026, 'History', 'This investigation analyzes the continuity of government (COG), national security, and emergency preparedness architecture established during Donald Trump’s second presidential term (January 2025–February 2026) through a systematic examination of Executive Orders, DoD Directives, Presidential actions, and related authorities. The analysis employs quantitative anomaly scoring (0–100 scales) and dependency mapping to assess whether observed patterns represent normal executive governance or unprecedented concentration/transformation of COG infrastructure **perplexity pro labs aided in the creation of the value matrix and data retention** thank u!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/trump-cog-anomalies-2026-md-pdf', 'https://archive.org/details/trump-cog-anomalies-2026-md-pdf', 'internet-archive:trump-cog-anomalies-2026-md-pdf'),
