  ('516172005482961782', 'Washington Commanders 2025 Media Guide', 'Washington Redskins', 2025, 'History', 'A media guide produced by the Washington Commanders in preparation for the 2025 National Football League (NFL) season. This edition, the 94th in the team''s history, gave historical statistics and information on the Commanders club that was led by Head coach Dan Quinn. The team was known as the Washington Redskins until changing to the Washington Football Team for 2020-2021 and then rebranding to the Washington Commanders for the 2022 NFL Season.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/commanders-2025-media-guide-washington-c', 'https://archive.org/details/commanders-2025-media-guide-washington-c', 'internet-archive:commanders-2025-media-guide-washington-c'),
  ('1042812744501452936', 'Washington Nationals 2026 Media Guide', 'Washington Nationals', 2026, 'History', 'A media guide produced by the Washington Nationals in preparation for the 2026 Major League Baseball (MLB) season. This edition, the 58th in the team''s history, gave historical statistics and information on the Nationals club that was led by Manager Blake Butera. The team was founded as the ''Montreal Expos'' and played in Canada from 1969 through 2004 before moving and becoming the ''Washington Nationals'' in 2005.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/washington-nationals-2026-media-guide-c', 'https://archive.org/details/washington-nationals-2026-media-guide-c', 'internet-archive:washington-nationals-2026-media-guide-c'),
