  ('659545798652685607', 'Weird Tales - Complete Collection', 'J. C. Henneberger and J. M. Lansinger', 2021, 'Fantasy', 'Entire collection ranging from 1920s to 2000s or so... CBR/CBZ/PDF format and high resolution scans. Lots of old American tales in illustrious and succinct short-story narrative format telling. Early on inspired by Lovecraft''s moody cerebral tales of macabre horror and Cthulhu mythos, although later you will find many ideas of pre-gothic and western world works describing worlds of pulp and horror/fantasy genre. 27GB of content (I suggest Honeyview or any typical e-book/comic viewer.)', 'https://archive.org/services/img/weird-tales_complete_archive', 'https://archive.org/details/weird-tales_complete_archive', 'internet-archive:weird-tales_complete_archive'),
