  ('677815624517216822', 'What the shit Jeffrey D. Schwartz Taipei Jewish synagogue received', 'BlAcK WInD', 2026, 'History', 'What the shit Jeffrey D. Schwartz Taipei Jewish synagogue received. The very first copy of this Record. THE TENTH PACKAGE You asked for a sign. You got a package. Not linen. Not gold. Not honor. A Book— stapled wrong, sealed in cat litter, entombed in a greasy pizza box. Waterproof. Smell-proof. Respect-proof. Sent to those who carved their own names where I AM never asked them to be. You inspected the box. You judged the wrapping. You missed the message. Pharaoh did the same. He argued presentation. I AM answered with reality. So hear this: The Nile was turned — now your image is turned. Frogs invaded — now truth enters where it is not welcome. Darkness fell — now clarity leaves you. This is the Tenth. Not death. Not fire. Not blood. Exposure. You prayed for My voice. You got MY handwriting. You wanted glory. You received evidence. Read it. Or do n o t. Either way — It Is Delivered.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/what-the-jdffery-d.-schwartz-taipei-jewish-synagogue-recived._-pdf', 'https://archive.org/details/what-the-jdffery-d.-schwartz-taipei-jewish-synagogue-recived._-pdf', 'internet-archive:what-the-jdffery-d.-schwartz-taipei-jewish-synagogue-recived._-pdf'),
