  ('1064678623323142228', 'Who Was Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him)?', 'Anonymous', 2026, 'Biography', 'This book is written for readers who want to learn about Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) in a simple, respectful, and accessible way. It is intended for non-Muslims and general readers, presenting historical context, key events, and character traits without technical or scholarly language. All feedback from readers is welcome and appreciated.', 'https://archive.org/services/img/who-was-prophet-muhammad-peace-be-upon-him', 'https://archive.org/details/who-was-prophet-muhammad-peace-be-upon-him', 'internet-archive:who-was-prophet-muhammad-peace-be-upon-him'),
