  ('841475557255181867', 'Witness To Power Disappearances Murders Arrests Freemasons Venezuela Oria 2026', 'José Esteban Oria', 2026, 'Science', 'This open-access academic work documents a documentary and testimonial investigation into enforced disappearances, murders, arbitrary arrests, and political persecution of Freemasons in Venezuela. The research is based on primary eyewitness testimonies, judicial documents, institutional reports, and a chronological reconstruction of events. It identifies patterns of institutional repression and traces the chain of command leading to the highest levels of political power. This publication forms part of a broader open-access academic project preserved across multiple international repositories, including Zenodo (DOI), HAL, OSF, and SSRN, ensuring long-term preservation, transparency, and traceability of sources. Author: José Esteban Oria Year: 2026 Edition: Open-Access Academic Edition', 'https://archive.org/services/img/witness-to-power-disappearances-murders-arrests-freemasons-venezuela-oria-2026', 'https://archive.org/details/witness-to-power-disappearances-murders-arrests-freemasons-venezuela-oria-2026', 'internet-archive:witness-to-power-disappearances-murders-arrests-freemasons-venezuela-oria-2026'),
