  ('348967625674600705', 'Yaşamın Temeli (Ansiklopedi)', 'Sahne Dünya', 2026, 'Science', 'How does life originate? First of all, the bodies of living things are made up of bonding elements, but bonding elements alone don''t create a living thing, do they? So how is this possible? Could nitrogen, which seems insignificant, be a hidden hero? A solvent is needed for life, but is it only water? Read the PDF to see the details. Enjoy!', 'https://archive.org/services/img/yasamin-temeli-ansiklopedi', 'https://archive.org/details/yasamin-temeli-ansiklopedi', 'internet-archive:yasamin-temeli-ansiklopedi'),
