  ('21248139043080763', 'Your Legacy Beyond Wealth: A Discovery Workbook for Building a Life That Outlasts You', 'Gabriel Killian', 2026, 'History', 'A 23-page guided workbook for identifying and preserving the non-financial dimensions of personal legacy . Organized around six legacy types: voice, wisdom, truth, history, presence, and clarity. Includes a personal legacy inventory, guided prompts, family story mapping, tradition documentation, and end-of-life clarity checklists. Built on research from Age Wave, The Gerontologist, and Stanford University. Free resource from Memorial Merits. Read the full article and guide: https://memorialmerits.com/how-to-leave-a-legacy-beyond-money/ Library of PDF Guides and Workbooks from Memorial Merits: https://memorialmerits.com/free-resources/', 'https://archive.org/services/img/your-legacy-beyond-wealth-workbook-2', 'https://archive.org/details/your-legacy-beyond-wealth-workbook-2', 'internet-archive:your-legacy-beyond-wealth-workbook-2'),
