  ('886937686140016836', 'Zaregoto Series 1-9 [Vertical, Dutch Angle TL, Suiminchuudoku, Sway TL] [ACTS]', 'ACTS', 2026, 'Literature', 'This is a compilation torrent of the Zaregoto series by NISIOISIN (volumes 1-9) (epubs and pdfs). Thank you to LuCaZ for providing the official Vertical translations for volumes 1-3. Volumes 4-5 (Psycho Logical) have been replaced with the new translations done by DutchAngleTL. https://dutchangletl.wordpress.com/ Volumes 6-9 are the same as before, provided by Suiminchuudoku and SwayTL. https://swaytranslations.wordpress.com/ Please support the original author if you can. https://kodansha.us/series/zaregoto/', 'https://archive.org/services/img/zaregoto-series-1-9-vertical-dutch-angle-tl-suiminchuudoku-sway-tl-acts', 'https://archive.org/details/zaregoto-series-1-9-vertical-dutch-angle-tl-suiminchuudoku-sway-tl-acts', 'internet-archive:zaregoto-series-1-9-vertical-dutch-angle-tl-suiminchuudoku-sway-tl-acts'),
